1
00:02:17,066 --> 00:02:18,385
Hisarcik.

2
00:02:18,826 --> 00:02:20,385
Gevye.

3
00:02:21,066 --> 00:02:22,385
Yeni Kale (The New Castle)

4
00:02:23,066 --> 00:02:24,865
Tus Bazaar.

5
00:02:26,066 --> 00:02:27,865
And Akkhisar.

6
00:02:32,826 --> 00:02:35,385
Baysungur and the brave
men that followed him.

7
00:02:36,346 --> 00:02:40,105
To make those lands become Turk lands...

8
00:02:41,346 --> 00:02:43,865
...they fought hard.

9
00:02:44,826 --> 00:02:47,105
And they became martyrs in the end.

10
00:02:48,066 --> 00:02:52,105
God willing, we will become
martyrs after them, my Bey.

11
00:02:52,586 --> 00:02:54,636
One of us may become
a martyr but with the help

12
00:02:54,648 --> 00:02:56,625
of Allah, a thousand
more will go for shahada.

13
00:02:57,066 --> 00:03:01,105
With the help of Allah.

14
00:03:01,826 --> 00:03:02,685
Orhan.

15
00:03:02,685 --> 00:03:03,545
My Bey.

16
00:03:03,545 --> 00:03:05,245
Inform llbay.

17
00:03:05,586 --> 00:03:09,385
Whoever martyred Baysungur
and the brave men with him...

18
00:03:09,386 --> 00:03:10,865
...he should sneak into Lucas’ ranks...

19
00:03:11,066 --> 00:03:12,625
..and learn about it.

20
00:03:12,626 --> 00:03:14,105
As you command my Bey.

21
00:03:16,066 --> 00:03:17,625
We are going to...

22
00:03:18,586 --> 00:03:20,625
...strike that infidel so hard.

23
00:03:21,826 --> 00:03:24,385
Strike him so hard!

24
00:03:24,386 --> 00:03:26,625
My Bey, I think...

25
00:03:26,826 --> 00:03:29,385
...we should go for Gevye.

26
00:03:29,826 --> 00:03:31,625
It has a weak defence.

27
00:03:33,066 --> 00:03:35,865
I think we should go for Hisarcik castle.

28
00:03:36,066 --> 00:03:38,625
That's on of the most
prosperous castles of Byzantine.

29
00:03:39,066 --> 00:03:41,385
There will be good booty.

30
00:03:42,826 --> 00:03:44,105
No.

31
00:03:46,826 --> 00:03:50,385
All those castles are our targets.

32
00:03:50,586 --> 00:03:53,385
But the most important one is..

33
00:03:53,826 --> 00:03:55,625
..due to its location..

34
00:03:57,066 --> 00:03:58,625
...the Akhisar.

35
00:03:59,826 --> 00:04:01,865
If we take Akhisar...

36
00:04:02,066 --> 00:04:06,625
...then the land trade around
it will be under our control.

37
00:04:07,066 --> 00:04:11,105
This will also harm Karesi Bey too.

38
00:04:20,065 --> 00:04:22,625
Tell me, are the armies ready?

39
00:04:22,626 --> 00:04:26,865
Our army is read to
defeat the infidels, my Bey.

40
00:04:26,866 --> 00:04:28,865
Alright.

41
00:04:29,346 --> 00:04:30,865
Bayhan Bey and Gencer Bey.

42
00:04:30,866 --> 00:04:34,385
When the bring their
armies in front of Akhisar...

43
00:04:35,346 --> 00:04:36,625
...then..

44
00:04:37,346 --> 00:04:40,385
...we will go for a great conquest.

45
00:04:41,346 --> 00:04:43,865
Since you mentioned Karesi Bey.

46
00:04:44,066 --> 00:04:46,625
I got word from Karadin my Bey.

47
00:04:47,066 --> 00:04:50,865
Karasi Bey increased the taxes
and caused unrest among people.

48
00:04:51,066 --> 00:04:54,105
You should focus on Sogut, Begun Hatun.

49
00:04:54,346 --> 00:04:55,865
Not Karadin.

50
00:04:56,586 --> 00:04:59,865
The trade shouldn't be interrupted.

51
00:05:02,346 --> 00:05:04,105
Bala Hatun is right.

52
00:05:05,586 --> 00:05:07,865
Begum Hatun..

53
00:05:08,346 --> 00:05:10,865
...take your duty in Sogut.

54
00:05:10,866 --> 00:05:13,105
As you command my Bey.

55
00:05:16,346 --> 00:05:19,385
Yusuf Bey, Saruca Bey.

56
00:05:19,586 --> 00:05:24,105
You are responsible for Sogut's
security and caravans' safety.

57
00:05:24,346 --> 00:05:26,865
As you command my Bey.

58
00:05:32,826 --> 00:05:34,625
Orhan Alaeddin.

59
00:05:35,586 --> 00:05:37,385
Get ready.

60
00:05:38,586 --> 00:05:43,105
Before we conquer Akhisar, we will...

61
00:05:43,106 --> 00:05:45,105
...raid the villages and
bases that Supply...

62
00:05:45,106 --> 00:05:47,385
...Akhfear with ammunition and food.

63
00:05:47,386 --> 00:05:50,105
As you command my Bey.

64
00:05:58,066 --> 00:05:59,865
We will..

65
00:06:00,346 --> 00:06:02,625
...take Baysungur's revenge.

66
00:06:17,586 --> 00:06:20,105
Baysungur, whom you killed...

67
00:06:20,826 --> 00:06:24,105
...was one of Osman’s closest men.

68
00:06:38,066 --> 00:06:40,865
He is in hell together with others.

69
00:06:43,066 --> 00:06:44,385
We will see..

70
00:06:45,586 --> 00:06:48,865
...what Osman will do without his spies.

71
00:07:07,066 --> 00:07:09,625
Osman is just like...

72
00:07:10,346 --> 00:07:13,865
...a cornered cockroach right now.

73
00:07:22,346 --> 00:07:24,105
He'll attack.

74
00:07:43,066 --> 00:07:45,865
I'm not afraid of him.

75
00:07:52,346 --> 00:07:54,105
Osman’s daughter...

76
00:07:55,586 --> 00:07:58,865
If I took Fatma Hatun from him...

77
00:08:00,346 --> 00:08:02,625
...that will devastate him.

78
00:08:03,826 --> 00:08:07,385
Osman would come after us.

79
00:08:07,826 --> 00:08:10,105
And to lure him to my trap..

80
00:08:10,346 --> 00:08:14,105
...I'll plan step by step slowly.

81
00:08:35,065 --> 00:08:35,865
My Bey.

82
00:08:46,066 --> 00:08:46,865
These days...

83
00:08:48,066 --> 00:08:49,865
..I feel worried.

84
00:08:51,066 --> 00:08:52,865
So do you, Bala.

85
00:08:57,586 --> 00:08:58,625
I'm fine my Bey.

86
00:08:59,346 --> 00:09:01,105
Same old, same old.

87
00:09:01,826 --> 00:09:03,625
Well...

88
00:09:05,066 --> 00:09:07,235
Just like how I attend the battle...

89
00:09:07,346 --> 00:09:09,865
...your duty here is as difficult as mine.

90
00:09:11,586 --> 00:09:13,385
I know why you're worried.

91
00:09:14,066 --> 00:09:15,105
I know.

92
00:09:20,346 --> 00:09:23,385
Gonca and Holofira, right?

93
00:09:24,826 --> 00:09:26,625
You don't miss a thing.

94
00:09:27,586 --> 00:09:30,865
Tell me. We have all this trouble.

95
00:09:31,346 --> 00:09:32,625
How could you tell?

96
00:09:34,066 --> 00:09:35,625
From your eyes.

97
00:09:37,066 --> 00:09:38,385
But know this.

98
00:09:39,346 --> 00:09:40,865
They must make peace now.

99
00:09:41,826 --> 00:09:43,625
Enemies attack from all sides.

100
00:09:44,066 --> 00:09:46,105
We must have peace in the family.

101
00:09:46,586 --> 00:09:47,865
We'll be united.

102
00:09:48,346 --> 00:09:49,865
Don't worry my Bey.

103
00:09:50,826 --> 00:09:53,105
I'll find a way to make peace.

104
00:09:53,586 --> 00:09:55,105
They're young.

105
00:09:56,586 --> 00:09:57,865
Of course.

106
00:09:58,826 --> 00:10:00,625
It's because they're young.

107
00:10:00,826 --> 00:10:01,625
But...

108
00:10:02,066 --> 00:10:04,385
But after they learn from you..

109
00:10:05,586 --> 00:10:07,105
...they’ll be proper Bey Hatuns.

110
00:10:08,066 --> 00:10:09,385
God willing.

111
00:10:09,586 --> 00:10:12,625
Our children and the tribe
are yours to protect Bala.

112
00:10:15,826 --> 00:10:18,105
May Allah protect you.

113
00:10:26,066 --> 00:10:29,865
Girbay, you’ll find the
dastards who killed Baysungur.

114
00:10:30,066 --> 00:10:32,385
Even if they hide under rocks..

115
00:10:32,386 --> 00:10:35,625
...you'll find them 
no matter where they hide.

116
00:10:35,826 --> 00:10:37,625
This is your only duty.

117
00:10:38,066 --> 00:10:39,625
Don't worry my Shehzade.

118
00:10:40,826 --> 00:10:44,105
Alps found where Baysungur was martyred.

119
00:10:44,346 --> 00:10:47,105
I'll go there and follow the trail.

120
00:10:47,826 --> 00:10:49,865
But whoever it is..

121
00:10:50,346 --> 00:10:53,105
he must've found all the spies we have.

122
00:10:53,586 --> 00:10:56,625
Baysungur said it's not Karesibey...

123
00:10:56,626 --> 00:10:58,385
..nor was it Lukas, but...

124
00:10:58,386 --> 00:11:00,385
But...

125
00:11:00,826 --> 00:11:03,385
But it must be someone close to Lukas.

126
00:11:05,346 --> 00:11:07,865
Whoever it is, knows Lukas.

127
00:11:08,826 --> 00:11:12,105
Keep your eyes and ears open.

128
00:11:13,066 --> 00:11:15,105
Go soon. Come on.

129
00:11:15,826 --> 00:11:17,625
As you wish my Shehzade.

130
00:11:23,066 --> 00:11:25,105
Attention! Osman Beyl

131
00:11:52,346 --> 00:11:53,385
Beys

132
00:11:54,346 --> 00:11:55,625
Alps

133
00:11:56,346 --> 00:11:57,865
Those who know Shahada..

134
00:11:58,346 --> 00:11:59,625
...will never be defeated.

135
00:12:04,346 --> 00:12:05,625
Now tell me.

136
00:12:06,066 --> 00:12:09,625
Are you with me the path to Shahada?

137
00:12:09,626 --> 00:12:14,105
We're with you my Bey!

138
00:12:14,346 --> 00:12:17,865
Will you help me make
the infidels take the knee?

139
00:12:17,866 --> 00:12:21,865
We will my bey!
We will my bey!

140
00:12:21,866 --> 00:12:24,105
Do you swear to..

141
00:12:24,106 --> 00:12:26,105
...fight until your last breath

142
00:12:26,106 --> 00:12:30,865
-We do my bey!
-We do my bey!

143
00:12:32,346 --> 00:12:37,625
Then I promise to be the
one leading in the front.

144
00:12:38,066 --> 00:12:39,865
May Allah help us.

145
00:12:39,866 --> 00:12:41,385
Amen.

146
00:12:41,386 --> 00:12:43,105
May our war be holy.

147
00:12:43,106 --> 00:12:45,625
Ameen.

148
00:13:11,346 --> 00:13:14,105
May you have an easy journey my bey

149
00:14:00,826 --> 00:14:03,625
Allah who makes the clouds move...

150
00:14:03,826 --> 00:14:07,385
...and the enemy armies fail..

151
00:14:07,826 --> 00:14:10,534
...for the sake of our
martyrs who died while

152
00:14:10,546 --> 00:14:13,385
saying the shahada,
don't turn away our prayers.

153
00:14:13,386 --> 00:14:14,865
Amen.

154
00:14:14,866 --> 00:14:18,865
Give strength to my bey and his alps.

155
00:14:18,866 --> 00:14:21,105
Ameen

156
00:14:21,826 --> 00:14:25,105
Defeate the enemies and grant us
the vocitory, God willing.

157
00:14:25,106 --> 00:14:30,625
Ameen.

158
00:14:33,346 --> 00:14:36,865
Get ready, we are going to Sogut Bazaar.

159
00:14:36,866 --> 00:14:41,385
We will make Sogut the biggest
and busiest bazaar around here.

160
00:14:41,386 --> 00:14:42,625
Come on

161
00:14:51,826 --> 00:14:56,105
My bey, thes men are mong the
most respected en in Karadin Castle.

162
00:14:56,106 --> 00:14:58,105
They want to tell you something.

163
00:14:58,106 --> 00:15:00,625
Tell me what your problem is.

164
00:15:00,626 --> 00:15:04,385
My bey, the taxes you decided for
us has put too much pressure on us.

165
00:15:04,586 --> 00:15:06,625
We don't make much.

166
00:15:06,626 --> 00:15:08,865
We can't shoulder this sum.

167
00:15:09,066 --> 00:15:12,625
Osman Bey didn't do this,
he showed us mercy.

168
00:15:12,626 --> 00:15:14,865
We’ve started to miss
the old days, Karesi Bey.

169
00:15:14,866 --> 00:15:18,865
We pay the sum Osman Bey decided on.

170
00:15:18,866 --> 00:15:20,625
We can’t afford any more than that.

171
00:15:20,626 --> 00:15:24,105
If not you won't be able to stop
an upcoming riot Karesi Bey.

172
00:15:24,106 --> 00:15:27,385
You money hungry dogs.

173
00:15:28,826 --> 00:15:31,625
You ungrateful folk.

174
00:15:32,586 --> 00:15:35,865
How dare you act
disrespectly in my presence?

175
00:15:35,866 --> 00:15:38,625
Osman isn't here anymore.

176
00:15:38,626 --> 00:15:40,865
The old order is no more.

177
00:15:40,866 --> 00:15:43,385
It's my rule.

178
00:15:43,826 --> 00:15:49,385
The price of living a peaceful
life behind these walls...

179
00:15:49,386 --> 00:15:50,865
...will be paid.

180
00:15:50,866 --> 00:15:55,105
The destiny of those
who won't is horrible.

181
00:15:55,106 --> 00:15:59,385
Now get out of my sight.

182
00:15:59,586 --> 00:16:01,625
Get lost.

183
00:16:05,586 --> 00:16:07,625
Sancar.

184
00:16:07,626 --> 00:16:09,385
Yes, my bey.

185
00:16:09,386 --> 00:16:13,385
I don’t want to witness
disrespect like this ever again.

186
00:16:13,386 --> 00:16:16,865
The one who raises
their voice will be silenced.

187
00:16:16,866 --> 00:16:18,385
As you wish my bey.

188
00:16:18,386 --> 00:16:19,865
Tell me.

189
00:16:19,866 --> 00:16:22,385
Is then any word from Kanyumaz?

190
00:16:22,386 --> 00:16:24,625
He is following Osman Bey's every move.

191
00:16:24,626 --> 00:16:27,105
But there is still no
word from him, my bey.

192
00:16:27,106 --> 00:16:32,625
Osman acted keen
with the trade issue but...

193
00:16:32,626 --> 00:16:36,105
..because of his spies’ deaths...

194
00:16:37,066 --> 00:16:41,625
...he will attack like a wounded animal.

195
00:16:42,066 --> 00:16:44,385
Continue to watch him.

196
00:16:44,586 --> 00:16:48,865
We won't let Osman have a chance.

197
00:16:48,866 --> 00:16:50,865
Never.

198
00:17:08,346 --> 00:17:11,385
Bala Hatun is coming to the Bazaar today.

199
00:17:11,386 --> 00:17:13,625
Make sure we are ready.

200
00:17:13,826 --> 00:17:15,865
I don't want anything to be unfinished.

201
00:17:21,346 --> 00:17:22,625
Hello.

202
00:17:23,586 --> 00:17:28,105
They told me this bazaar
is under your responsibility.

203
00:17:29,826 --> 00:17:32,625
Begum Hatun, right?

204
00:17:32,826 --> 00:17:34,385
Yes, it is.

205
00:17:34,386 --> 00:17:37,625
My name is Veronica.

206
00:17:43,346 --> 00:17:44,625
I'm a trader.

207
00:17:44,826 --> 00:17:49,865
I bring caravans to the
bazaar from China to Rome.

208
00:17:49,866 --> 00:17:52,105
I've seen your face for the first time.

209
00:17:52,346 --> 00:17:55,105
And I haven't heard your name before.

210
00:17:56,826 --> 00:17:59,385
Because that's my
first visit to the borders.

211
00:18:00,346 --> 00:18:05,865
I wanted to have a look at Sogut Bazaar,
after Thea rd it and I'm glad that I did.

212
00:18:06,346 --> 00:18:08,865
What I heard was not even close.

213
00:18:17,066 --> 00:18:20,625
So, you are trading with the
personal permission of .the Emperor?

214
00:18:20,626 --> 00:18:21,865
Yes.

215
00:18:22,066 --> 00:18:26,625
And I want to trade with you very much.

216
00:18:28,586 --> 00:18:31,105
Let’s know you first.

217
00:18:32,586 --> 00:18:34,385
Trader Veronica..

218
00:18:34,386 --> 00:18:37,865
Please, explore our bazaar.

219
00:18:38,346 --> 00:18:40,385
Thank you

220
00:18:46,586 --> 00:18:49,385
From China to Rome, huh?

221
00:18:52,826 --> 00:18:55,385
Investigate this woman well.

222
00:18:55,586 --> 00:18:59,385
Let's see if she is a trader
as great as she claims.

223
00:19:20,826 --> 00:19:22,625
Allah is the Greatest!

224
00:19:30,346 --> 00:19:31,385
Baysungur.

225
00:19:31,386 --> 00:19:34,625
My warrior, then, you did a great job

226
00:19:45,066 --> 00:19:48,105
What am I going td do?
I'm going to die of starvation!

227
00:19:48,346 --> 00:19:52,385
I'm going to suffer and die! I'll die!

228
00:19:52,586 --> 00:19:55,625
What am I going to do, my brothers?

229
00:19:56,826 --> 00:20:00,865
Where should we put
the Cerkutay Bey's goat?

230
00:20:05,586 --> 00:20:07,625
My brother!

231
00:20:11,346 --> 00:20:12,865
Welcome, Bala Hatun

232
00:20:12,866 --> 00:20:16,385
Thank you. Thank you. May it be easy.

233
00:20:19,066 --> 00:20:20,105
Ulgen.

234
00:20:22,586 --> 00:20:24,385
Welcome, Bala Hatun.

235
00:20:24,386 --> 00:20:27,385
Thank you. Thank you.

236
00:20:27,586 --> 00:20:32,865
Tell me, Ulgen. How do the
people treat Holofira Hatun?

237
00:20:33,066 --> 00:20:35,105
Like fire.

238
00:20:35,106 --> 00:20:39,105
Everyone sulks when
they hear Holofira's name.

239
00:20:39,586 --> 00:20:43,625
So, the rebellion have made
the situation worse, huh?

240
00:20:48,066 --> 00:20:52,625
We need to extinguish that
fire before it gets bigger, Ulgen.

241
00:20:54,066 --> 00:20:56,105
They don't know Holofira.

242
00:20:56,346 --> 00:21:00,105
If they do, that fire
will go off by itself.

243
00:21:03,066 --> 00:21:04,865
They will know her.

244
00:21:11,066 --> 00:21:12,865
May it be easy, sisters.

245
00:21:12,866 --> 00:21:15,385
-Welcome, Gonca Hatun
-Welcome!

246
00:21:15,386 --> 00:21:18,105
Hatun.
Welcome, Gonca Hatun.

247
00:21:18,106 --> 00:21:19,625
Welcome.

248
00:21:19,826 --> 00:21:22,625
May it be easy, Hatuns.

249
00:21:37,066 --> 00:21:41,385
We say may it be easy,
sisters! What's going on?

250
00:21:41,826 --> 00:21:44,385
You don't want it to be easy, huh?

251
00:21:48,346 --> 00:21:50,385
I'm talking to you!

252
00:21:50,386 --> 00:21:51,865
Thank you, Holofira Hatun.

253
00:21:51,866 --> 00:21:53,385
-Thank you.
-Welcome.

254
00:21:53,586 --> 00:21:55,105
Welcome, Bala Hatun.

255
00:21:55,106 --> 00:21:58,385
-Welcome.
-Welcome, Bala Hatun.

256
00:22:11,586 --> 00:22:16,385
Tomorrow we are going to feed
all our merchants in the bazaar.

257
00:22:18,066 --> 00:22:22,105
We will enlarge our bazaar
with prosperity, God willing.

258
00:22:22,346 --> 00:22:25,385
God willing.

259
00:22:26,066 --> 00:22:28,865
Fatma will take care of the food.

260
00:22:31,346 --> 00:22:32,865
Bala.

261
00:22:34,346 --> 00:22:36,625
I am back, Bala.

262
00:22:38,346 --> 00:22:41,625
I came to settle our records.

263
00:22:43,346 --> 00:22:44,865
Hazal Hatun.

264
00:22:45,586 --> 00:22:49,105
You are responsible for the
classification of the upcoming goods.

265
00:22:49,826 --> 00:22:52,105
As you command Bala Hatun.

266
00:22:55,586 --> 00:22:59,105
The most important duty...

267
00:22:59,346 --> 00:23:01,625
...belongs to you, my daughters.

268
00:23:04,346 --> 00:23:06,105
The stalls.

269
00:23:07,066 --> 00:23:11,625
From now on, Holofira
will be responsible for the...

270
00:23:11,826 --> 00:23:14,385
...stalls in North.

271
00:23:16,346 --> 00:23:18,625
And the South..

272
00:23:19,066 --> 00:23:21,115
....will be under Gonca's responsibility.

273
00:23:21,826 --> 00:23:23,385
As you command mother.

274
00:23:25,826 --> 00:23:28,625
I know it's not my place to say...

275
00:23:31,346 --> 00:23:34,625
..but does Holofira Hatun..

276
00:23:34,626 --> 00:23:37,105
...know the traditions in our bazaar?

277
00:23:41,346 --> 00:23:43,105
What if she can't make
it in time for tomorrow?

278
00:23:43,346 --> 00:23:48,105
My daughters will support each other.

279
00:23:53,586 --> 00:23:56,385
Holofira is the
daughter-in-law of Kayi family.

280
00:23:56,586 --> 00:23:57,865
Let it be known!

281
00:24:03,646 --> 00:24:07,865
Also, my daughter will
learn everything on duty.

282
00:24:09,346 --> 00:24:11,865
I will not disappoint you mother Bala.

283
00:24:12,826 --> 00:24:16,385
Gonca will help you
with anything you lack.

284
00:24:17,826 --> 00:24:19,625
Right Gonca?

285
00:24:21,346 --> 00:24:23,105
I will do what's necessary, mother.

286
00:24:23,826 --> 00:24:24,865
Good.

287
00:24:30,066 --> 00:24:33,625
Kayi's hatuns go on,
show me your skills.

288
00:24:35,826 --> 00:24:40,625
Until tomorrow, I want all
the food and stalls be ready.

289
00:24:41,066 --> 00:24:43,625
As you command Bala Hatun.

290
00:24:48,346 --> 00:24:49,625
My girls.

291
00:24:51,346 --> 00:24:53,105
I trust you.

292
00:24:53,826 --> 00:24:55,705
Don't disappoint me.

293
00:24:58,066 --> 00:24:59,105
Come on.

294
00:25:02,826 --> 00:25:04,385
Come on Gulce.

295
00:25:10,586 --> 00:25:12,385
Fatma Hatun.

296
00:25:13,066 --> 00:25:15,105
This will suit you.

297
00:25:26,826 --> 00:25:29,545
Get down!

298
00:26:07,066 --> 00:26:09,625
My Bey, alps are sneaking in quietly.

299
00:26:11,586 --> 00:26:13,865
Boran, tell me.

300
00:26:14,066 --> 00:26:17,625
How did they settle in this mine?

301
00:26:17,626 --> 00:26:19,630
Resources go to
Akhisar castle and the

302
00:26:19,642 --> 00:26:21,865
base that protects
the castle from outside.

303
00:26:22,066 --> 00:26:24,385
They loaded them onto the
carts, they will go out soon.

304
00:26:32,346 --> 00:26:35,105
We will destroy the mine first.

305
00:26:35,106 --> 00:26:37,385
Then we will go after the caravan.

306
00:26:38,066 --> 00:26:39,625
We will..

307
00:26:39,826 --> 00:26:42,625
..enter the base with their swords!

308
00:26:52,346 --> 00:26:55,865
Water!

309
00:27:06,346 --> 00:27:08,385
Oh Allah!

310
00:27:16,586 --> 00:27:17,865
Allah is Everlasting!

311
00:27:17,866 --> 00:27:19,865
Allah is Truthful!

312
00:27:27,586 --> 00:27:31,105
Even if we killed a thousand
of you, we'd still feel anger.

313
00:27:31,106 --> 00:27:34,865
Allah is the Greatest!

314
00:27:38,826 --> 00:27:42,625
These cruel dastards are going to hell!

315
00:27:48,586 --> 00:27:49,865
Martyrs will never die!

316
00:28:11,826 --> 00:28:14,625
Please. Please don’t kill us.

317
00:28:15,066 --> 00:28:17,505
Pull out your hand

318
00:28:20,586 --> 00:28:22,385
Please! Please!

319
00:28:26,586 --> 00:28:30,105
Come here! Come here!

320
00:28:30,346 --> 00:28:33,865
Don't worry.

321
00:28:33,866 --> 00:28:36,865
We would never harm an innocent man.

322
00:28:39,586 --> 00:28:40,625
Boran. Water!

323
00:28:40,626 --> 00:28:42,105
Okay my Bey.

324
00:28:46,826 --> 00:28:49,105
May God bless you.

325
00:28:49,586 --> 00:28:52,425
Allah bless you.

326
00:28:55,586 --> 00:28:58,385
Water! Water!

327
00:29:02,826 --> 00:29:03,865
Travel in peace.

328
00:29:03,866 --> 00:29:05,385
Boran.
My Bey.

329
00:29:05,386 --> 00:29:06,385
Give me the pouch.

330
00:29:09,586 --> 00:29:10,385
Here my Bey.

331
00:29:14,586 --> 00:29:15,865
Here you go.

332
00:29:15,866 --> 00:29:16,865
Thank you.

333
00:29:17,786 --> 00:29:18,515
Come on.

334
00:29:18,515 --> 00:29:19,575
Travel in peace.

335
00:29:19,575 --> 00:29:20,625
Get up.

336
00:29:20,626 --> 00:29:21,625
AIps help.

337
00:29:23,346 --> 00:29:24,385
Thank you.

338
00:29:26,346 --> 00:29:27,625
May God bless you.

339
00:29:28,066 --> 00:29:30,865
If the poor can't eat...

340
00:29:30,866 --> 00:29:32,865
..I can't eat a single bite.

341
00:29:32,866 --> 00:29:34,865
So this is yours.

342
00:29:35,066 --> 00:29:38,385
Travel in peace.

343
00:29:39,066 --> 00:29:40,105
Allah bless you.

344
00:29:43,066 --> 00:29:46,385
Come on. Let's go after
them before they get away.

345
00:29:47,126 --> 00:29:48,105
Let's go.

346
00:30:08,176 --> 00:30:11,455
Byzantine Town

347
00:30:19,346 --> 00:30:20,435
This defense...

348
00:30:21,066 --> 00:30:23,385
...is as good as that of a castle's.

349
00:30:23,386 --> 00:30:25,625
They’re growing the Akhisar storage.

350
00:30:26,346 --> 00:30:27,865
They're watching.

351
00:30:28,346 --> 00:30:29,865
When they see a sign of invasion....

352
00:30:30,346 --> 00:30:34,105
...they will immediately
signal other castes using torches.

353
00:30:38,826 --> 00:30:41,105
Those torches will never be fired.

354
00:30:41,826 --> 00:30:42,625
Brother.

355
00:30:43,346 --> 00:30:44,865
Is everything ready?

356
00:30:44,866 --> 00:30:45,865
Yes brother.

357
00:30:46,066 --> 00:30:47,385
Waiting to be ordered.

358
00:30:48,586 --> 00:30:51,385
Only thing the support army will see....

359
00:30:51,826 --> 00:30:54,385
...is the smoke from the ashes.

360
00:30:54,586 --> 00:30:55,865
Yes.

361
00:30:56,586 --> 00:30:58,625
You'll protect the torches Alaeddin.

362
00:30:58,626 --> 00:31:01,865
When you're in position, we'll attack!

363
00:31:02,066 --> 00:31:04,625
This den of devils
will collapse in itself.

364
00:31:05,346 --> 00:31:06,625
Alright.

365
00:31:07,586 --> 00:31:09,625
May our war be blessed.

366
00:31:09,626 --> 00:31:10,865
Come on.

367
00:31:29,066 --> 00:31:30,385
Bala Hatun.

368
00:31:31,346 --> 00:31:33,105
Enjoy it while you can.

369
00:31:34,346 --> 00:31:37,385
I swore to take everything from you.

370
00:31:37,586 --> 00:31:38,625
Soon.

371
00:31:43,346 --> 00:31:44,105
Mother.

372
00:31:49,346 --> 00:31:51,625
I added 10 more cauldrons for tomorrow.

373
00:31:52,066 --> 00:31:54,385
We never prepared this much before.

374
00:31:55,826 --> 00:31:59,385
As days go by, we grow in number.

375
00:31:59,826 --> 00:32:01,385
You did well.

376
00:32:01,386 --> 00:32:03,865
We'll need more.

377
00:32:04,346 --> 00:32:08,865
Tomorrow, everyone will see
how we grew our market, God willing.

378
00:32:20,066 --> 00:32:22,385
Hug your daughter.

379
00:32:22,586 --> 00:32:24,625
Hug her, Bala.

380
00:32:25,826 --> 00:32:28,625
Hug her while you can.

381
00:32:30,066 --> 00:32:32,105
Bala Hatun.

382
00:32:33,586 --> 00:32:35,105
Begum Hatun.

383
00:32:35,106 --> 00:32:37,385
What do you think of our bazaar?

384
00:32:37,386 --> 00:32:40,865
I wish to get your advice
because of your talents with trade.

385
00:32:40,866 --> 00:32:43,865
Good job Begum Hatun.

386
00:32:43,866 --> 00:32:46,385
You can't say for certain at day one.

387
00:32:46,386 --> 00:32:50,865
I wish to build a bazaar
worthy of Osman Bey and you.

388
00:32:50,866 --> 00:32:54,385
If you see any mistakes, tell me.

389
00:32:54,826 --> 00:33:00,385
It seems like this duty has
helped you a lot, Begum Hatun.

390
00:33:00,826 --> 00:33:02,625
Of course.

391
00:33:02,626 --> 00:33:06,385
May those who saw me fit
for this duty live a long life.

392
00:33:06,386 --> 00:33:08,105
Come drink some sherbet.

393
00:33:08,106 --> 00:33:09,385
I don't have time.

394
00:33:09,386 --> 00:33:12,865
I'll go to inspect the
Yenisehir tradesmen.

395
00:33:13,586 --> 00:33:16,385
Next time, God willing.

396
00:33:24,346 --> 00:33:28,105
So you decided to shave
off your thorns, Begum...

397
00:33:28,106 --> 00:33:30,865
Let's see what you're after now...

398
00:33:33,826 --> 00:33:34,625
Fatma.

399
00:33:34,626 --> 00:33:35,625
Mother.

400
00:33:35,626 --> 00:33:38,385
Keep watch over this place, daughter.

401
00:33:40,066 --> 00:33:42,625
Come on Kismet, we are leaving.

402
00:34:03,586 --> 00:34:05,385
Sister.

403
00:34:05,586 --> 00:34:09,103
I've prepared the alps for the
safety of the caravan tomorrow.

404
00:34:09,824 --> 00:34:14,385
But working with Saruca...
I don't like it at all, just so you know.

405
00:34:16,065 --> 00:34:18,864
We will do whatever
Osman Bey tells us to do.

406
00:34:18,864 --> 00:34:20,864
No matter if you like it or not.

407
00:34:20,864 --> 00:34:22,385
We won't be in bad terms with him.

408
00:34:22,545 --> 00:34:24,025
You...

409
00:34:24,106 --> 00:34:27,385
That's why you get along with Bala Hatun.

410
00:34:27,585 --> 00:34:29,385
For me, then.

411
00:34:29,824 --> 00:34:32,103
Until we get what we want...

412
00:34:32,106 --> 00:34:35,385
..I have to hide my grudge.

413
00:34:35,385 --> 00:34:37,385
But when the time comes..

414
00:34:37,385 --> 00:34:40,864
...will not hold myself back
from showing my thorns Yusuf.

415
00:34:40,864 --> 00:34:42,623
Just so you know.

416
00:34:43,065 --> 00:34:44,103
Okay.

417
00:35:03,826 --> 00:35:06,385
What’s this? Go and check.

418
00:35:06,386 --> 00:35:08,865
Get him out of the way.

419
00:35:19,586 --> 00:35:21,625
Alps.

420
00:35:21,826 --> 00:35:24,865
That’s Osman Bey. Attack.

421
00:35:26,826 --> 00:35:28,625
Yes, Osman Bey.

422
00:35:28,626 --> 00:35:30,865
I came to take my men's revenge.

423
00:35:50,346 --> 00:35:52,105
For my brother.

424
00:36:02,346 --> 00:36:04,625
Gather.

425
00:36:11,826 --> 00:36:13,625
The real issue is the headquarters.

426
00:36:13,626 --> 00:36:15,625
When it falls..

427
00:36:15,626 --> 00:36:17,425
...the castle will be unprotected.

428
00:36:17,626 --> 00:36:20,865
Boran, load the gunpowder into the carts.

429
00:36:20,866 --> 00:36:22,625
We're leaving quickly.

430
00:36:22,626 --> 00:36:25,105
As you wish my bey.

431
00:36:46,066 --> 00:36:47,865
Where do you come from?

432
00:36:47,866 --> 00:36:49,105
Do you have permission to trade?

433
00:36:49,106 --> 00:36:50,385
Search it.

434
00:36:50,386 --> 00:36:54,425
I come from the Greek lands at the Borders,
I don't have permission to trade but...

435
00:36:54,425 --> 00:36:57,865
Those who don't have permission
have no place here, move your cart.

436
00:37:07,066 --> 00:37:09,105
We don't have permission.

437
00:37:09,586 --> 00:37:14,625
But we have many precious goods.

438
00:37:17,346 --> 00:37:21,385
If you let us pass, everyone wins.

439
00:37:23,546 --> 00:37:25,385
What do you mean?

440
00:37:27,586 --> 00:37:32,625
Most of the load of the trade from
Iranian territory is on our shoulder.

441
00:37:33,066 --> 00:37:38,865
It means each of these
caravans carries booty.

442
00:37:39,066 --> 00:37:42,865
Whoever clears our road and helps us...

443
00:37:45,826 --> 00:37:47,865
...takes his share.

444
00:38:01,586 --> 00:38:04,625
They have the trade
permission. Let them pass

445
00:38:08,586 --> 00:38:10,865
We'll see each other again.

446
00:38:11,826 --> 00:38:13,385
Let's go.

447
00:38:17,346 --> 00:38:21,385
Alps, when Alaaddin's Alps
take their place, we'll attack.

448
00:38:21,386 --> 00:38:25,385
There are kids and women
inside. Everyone shall be cautious.

449
00:38:25,386 --> 00:38:26,865
As you command, my Bey.

450
00:38:30,426 --> 00:38:32,385
We'll see huh?

451
00:38:35,586 --> 00:38:37,105
Let's go.

452
00:38:39,066 --> 00:38:41,385
How did you know they
were going to let us pass?

453
00:38:42,346 --> 00:38:48,105
Beys, nobles and captives
are sold in this bazaar.

454
00:38:48,586 --> 00:38:52,105
Do you think some
jackals cannot be sold here?

455
00:38:52,346 --> 00:38:56,625
We'll support each
other in this bazaar and...

456
00:38:56,826 --> 00:38:59,625
...we'll destroy this den of dogs.

457
00:38:59,826 --> 00:39:01,385
We'll do it!

458
00:39:06,826 --> 00:39:11,105
Come on, sisters! Make
sure all the stalls are tidy.

459
00:39:11,106 --> 00:39:14,385
No job will be left for
tomorrow, God willing.

460
00:39:14,386 --> 00:39:20,385
Allah is great! God willing, 
the Hatuns will finish on time.

461
00:39:25,066 --> 00:39:28,105
Hatuns, be hasty.

462
00:39:28,346 --> 00:39:30,625
The stalls must be ready until tomorrow.

463
00:39:30,826 --> 00:39:35,625
Check the goods, too. 
There must be no mistake, okay?

464
00:39:38,066 --> 00:39:41,865
I heard the honesty in the
Turkish Bazaars all the time.

465
00:39:43,346 --> 00:39:45,865
I've seen it was true.

466
00:39:47,586 --> 00:39:50,385
I'm sorry. I haven't introduce myself.

467
00:39:50,386 --> 00:39:52,385
Trade Veronica.

468
00:39:53,416 --> 00:39:59,865
As far as I know,
you are the brides of Osman Bey, aren't you?

469
00:40:01,346 --> 00:40:03,105
We are.
We are.

470
00:40:03,346 --> 00:40:06,105
Welcome. I'm Gonca.

471
00:40:12,586 --> 00:40:14,105
Holofira.

472
00:40:15,066 --> 00:40:17,625
-Is it your first time in Sogut?
-It is.

473
00:40:18,066 --> 00:40:22,105
But loved Sogut.
I mean I feel like...

474
00:40:23,346 --> 00:40:27,385
..I knew this place before.

475
00:40:29,066 --> 00:40:31,105
And I am Hazal Hatun.

476
00:40:33,586 --> 00:40:35,865
I am Ayhan Bey's Hatun.

477
00:40:37,346 --> 00:40:39,385
Where are you coming from?

478
00:40:39,386 --> 00:40:41,385
From China.

479
00:40:45,346 --> 00:40:47,625
Gonca Hatun.

480
00:40:47,826 --> 00:40:51,625
Holofira Hatun. I have
some business to handle but...

481
00:40:51,626 --> 00:40:55,865
...I want to know you more
familiarly as soon as possible.

482
00:40:56,066 --> 00:40:58,385
-Of course.
-Of course.

483
00:41:11,066 --> 00:41:13,865
I heard something but...

484
00:41:14,346 --> 00:41:19,385
Holofira Hatun wanted to
put Greek Hatuns on the stalls.

485
00:41:19,386 --> 00:41:21,105
She didn't like you.

486
00:41:21,586 --> 00:41:24,385
But Gonca Hatun didn't accept it.

487
00:41:24,586 --> 00:41:26,993
As if it wasn’t enough
she caused the death

488
00:41:26,993 --> 00:41:29,605
of many of our sons,
she doesn't like us, too?

489
00:41:29,605 --> 00:41:31,865
Does she want what we earn?

490
00:41:32,066 --> 00:41:34,105
Let's go, Hatuns.

491
00:41:36,826 --> 00:41:39,865
Gonca Hatun.

492
00:41:40,826 --> 00:41:44,865
We want to work on your stalls from now on.

493
00:41:46,826 --> 00:41:51,385
How can it be, sisters?
Everyone has her duty.

494
00:41:51,586 --> 00:41:55,385
And don't you hear my mother? 
It can't happen.

495
00:41:55,386 --> 00:41:58,385
Come on. Come on, sisters.
Go back to your duties.

496
00:41:58,386 --> 00:42:00,865
Then, we won't open our stalls.

497
00:42:01,066 --> 00:42:03,625
Let’s go back to the tribe, Hatunsi

498
00:42:05,066 --> 00:42:07,745
No one is going anywhere.

499
00:42:15,586 --> 00:42:18,625
This stall needs to be ready for tomorrow.

500
00:42:19,826 --> 00:42:21,865
We gave a promise to Bala Hatun.

501
00:42:22,066 --> 00:42:23,865
-Holofira Hatun.
-No!

502
00:42:23,866 --> 00:42:25,625
Until the stall is ready...

503
00:42:26,346 --> 00:42:28,385
..no one is leaving.

504
00:42:30,826 --> 00:42:32,385
Hatuns!

505
00:42:47,586 --> 00:42:49,385
Can I come in my Bey?

506
00:42:49,826 --> 00:42:50,865
Come in.

507
00:42:56,346 --> 00:42:57,625
My Bey...

508
00:42:58,346 --> 00:43:01,105
the people of Karadin quiets down.

509
00:43:01,586 --> 00:43:04,865
But they are holding a grudge.

510
00:43:05,586 --> 00:43:07,625
If it leads to a riot...

511
00:43:09,826 --> 00:43:13,625
What diminishes the state is...

512
00:43:13,626 --> 00:43:17,105
..the self serving commanders, Sancar.

513
00:43:18,586 --> 00:43:20,105
I won't let it happen.

514
00:43:22,066 --> 00:43:23,665
What do we do my Bey?
What is your command?

515
00:43:24,066 --> 00:43:28,775
Whoever is confusing the people
and tries to fool the people..

516
00:43:28,866 --> 00:43:31,385
...will be silenced right away.

517
00:43:31,826 --> 00:43:33,625
I am the state here.

518
00:43:34,826 --> 00:43:37,865
Whoever objects me, will be killed.

519
00:43:39,346 --> 00:43:40,625
May I come in my Bey?

520
00:43:42,066 --> 00:43:42,865
Come in.

521
00:43:46,826 --> 00:43:47,865
My Bey.

522
00:43:47,866 --> 00:43:50,105
Osman Bey attacked.

523
00:43:50,346 --> 00:43:51,625
To whom?

524
00:43:51,626 --> 00:43:52,625
Where?

525
00:43:52,826 --> 00:43:54,865
In the Kartal Yeni region, my Bey.

526
00:43:54,866 --> 00:43:57,865
He's attacking the mines and bases.

527
00:44:00,346 --> 00:44:03,385
Kartal Yeni?

528
00:44:05,066 --> 00:44:08,625
Osman Bey... What is
he after this time, my bey?

529
00:44:08,626 --> 00:44:11,105
Dark Osman..

530
00:44:11,346 --> 00:44:15,865
He wants to take the ruler of
trade routes, the most loved...

531
00:44:15,866 --> 00:44:19,625
...by the tradesmen, the Akhisar Castle.

532
00:44:20,826 --> 00:44:22,625
Akhisar?

533
00:44:22,626 --> 00:44:23,865
Oh no, my bey.

534
00:44:23,866 --> 00:44:25,865
If Osman takes that place...

535
00:44:25,866 --> 00:44:28,105
...then the tradesmen in
Karesi grounds will retreat.

536
00:44:28,106 --> 00:44:29,625
We won’t get any gold, my bey.

537
00:44:29,626 --> 00:44:31,385
They won't.

538
00:44:31,386 --> 00:44:33,625
We will get gold.

539
00:44:33,626 --> 00:44:38,385
I won't let anyone
lessen the gold I earn!

540
00:44:42,826 --> 00:44:44,625
Get ready.

541
00:44:44,826 --> 00:44:47,625
We are going to go to Lucas.

542
00:44:48,826 --> 00:44:50,865
As you wish my bey.

543
00:45:21,586 --> 00:45:23,105
Where are the others?

544
00:45:23,106 --> 00:45:24,345
On the way.

545
00:45:24,386 --> 00:45:28,105
Let's unload together. Come on!

546
00:45:33,346 --> 00:45:35,385
In the name of Allah.

547
00:45:35,386 --> 00:45:37,865
This is for Baysungur.

548
00:45:41,826 --> 00:45:44,625
It's a trap! Run away!

549
00:45:56,826 --> 00:45:59,105
Come on brave ones!
Don't let them breathe!

550
00:45:59,826 --> 00:46:03,865
Attack!

551
00:47:00,826 --> 00:47:03,865
Brother, I kill them.

552
00:47:04,826 --> 00:47:06,385
I kill them.

553
00:47:06,826 --> 00:47:08,385
But it's not going away.

554
00:47:08,826 --> 00:47:11,105
The fire in my heart is not going out.

555
00:47:11,826 --> 00:47:13,865
How will my sadness end?

556
00:47:17,346 --> 00:47:20,385
My pain is still there too, Cerkutay.

557
00:47:21,826 --> 00:47:24,385
I keep remembering Baystingur's eyes.

558
00:47:24,826 --> 00:47:26,865
His sacrifices.

559
00:47:28,346 --> 00:47:31,625
How is this going to end, Cerkutay?

560
00:47:33,156 --> 00:47:34,345
How?

561
00:47:38,826 --> 00:47:41,105
You are feeling sad for Baysungur.

562
00:47:43,346 --> 00:47:45,625
Don't.

563
00:47:46,066 --> 00:47:48,625
It's time for revenge, not grieving!

564
00:47:50,346 --> 00:47:52,865
Pull yourselves together!

565
00:47:54,066 --> 00:47:58,105
Today is not the day for lamenting
Today is the day we rise up!

566
00:48:06,826 --> 00:48:08,105
Lucas.

567
00:48:08,826 --> 00:48:12,385
Those walls you hide behind!

568
00:48:12,586 --> 00:48:14,625
They won't be
able to protect you!

569
00:48:15,066 --> 00:48:15,865
They won't!

570
00:48:17,586 --> 00:48:19,105
Come on brave ones!

571
00:48:43,586 --> 00:48:44,865
Alps.

572
00:48:45,066 --> 00:48:46,625
Get ready.

573
00:48:47,066 --> 00:48:48,625
It's time.

574
00:48:48,826 --> 00:48:50,625
Let's kill those dogs.

575
00:48:52,346 --> 00:48:53,625
Come on.

576
00:49:02,586 --> 00:49:08,105
Allah is the Greatest!

577
00:49:08,586 --> 00:49:10,105
We are under attack!

578
00:49:10,106 --> 00:49:13,865
They broke in! 
Light the torches!

579
00:49:14,346 --> 00:49:16,625
The Righteous!

580
00:49:18,586 --> 00:49:24,865
Allah is the Greatest!

581
00:49:35,826 --> 00:49:38,385
I have arrived brother!

582
00:49:50,826 --> 00:49:52,865
Allah is the Greatest!

583
00:50:53,966 --> 00:50:54,625
Gonca.

584
00:50:56,826 --> 00:50:58,055
Don't be afraid.

585
00:50:58,586 --> 00:51:01,105
No one will be hurt here.

586
00:51:01,346 --> 00:51:03,385
From now on, we'll protect you..

587
00:51:03,586 --> 00:51:05,385
...and everything you own.

588
00:51:05,826 --> 00:51:07,625
God protect you.

589
00:51:07,626 --> 00:51:08,625
Thank you.

590
00:51:09,066 --> 00:51:10,865
May Allah protect us all.

591
00:51:11,346 --> 00:51:12,385
Come here.

592
00:51:13,346 --> 00:51:15,385
In the name of Allah.

593
00:51:17,346 --> 00:51:18,865
Praise be.

594
00:51:18,866 --> 00:51:20,385
Oguz.
My Bey.

595
00:51:20,386 --> 00:51:22,385
Give him water.

596
00:51:22,386 --> 00:51:24,865
Turan, take him.

597
00:51:25,066 --> 00:51:28,105
Give him water and clean him up.

598
00:51:31,586 --> 00:51:33,625
Come here. Come.

599
00:51:39,346 --> 00:51:40,625
Are you okay?

600
00:51:40,626 --> 00:51:41,625
I'm okay, thanks.

601
00:51:41,626 --> 00:51:43,865
Good. Go to your homes.

602
00:51:44,346 --> 00:51:45,105
Is everyone okay?

603
00:51:45,106 --> 00:51:47,625
Yes Shehzade. All the soldiers are okay.

604
00:51:47,626 --> 00:51:48,865
Thank Allah.

605
00:51:49,066 --> 00:51:51,105
The goods in the carriages are ours.

606
00:51:51,586 --> 00:51:53,105
Give them to the people.

607
00:51:53,346 --> 00:51:54,385
As you wish my Shehzade.

608
00:51:54,386 --> 00:51:55,625
Thank you.

609
00:51:55,626 --> 00:51:57,105
Thank you Ekrem Bey.

610
00:51:57,346 --> 00:51:58,625
You came to us...

611
00:51:59,066 --> 00:52:00,865
...all the way from Ahiska lands.

612
00:52:01,346 --> 00:52:02,385
You supported us.

613
00:52:02,586 --> 00:52:04,865
And attacked the enemy with us.

614
00:52:05,346 --> 00:52:06,865
Thank you.

615
00:52:06,866 --> 00:52:12,385
Ahizka Turks will follow Osman Bey in
his path and support him my Shehzade.

616
00:52:12,586 --> 00:52:13,865
Thank you.

617
00:52:14,826 --> 00:52:16,865
The goods from Akhisar storage....

618
00:52:17,346 --> 00:52:18,865
It won't last them long.

619
00:52:19,586 --> 00:52:22,625
We'll get them eventually.

620
00:52:23,346 --> 00:52:25,385
Those who kill Turks.

621
00:52:25,586 --> 00:52:27,625
...will end up dead at
the end of our sword.

622
00:52:27,826 --> 00:52:32,105
I swear to Allah, we'll avenge
our martyrs and Baysungur.

623
00:52:32,346 --> 00:52:34,105
They'll either surrender...

624
00:52:34,106 --> 00:52:36,385
...or drown in blood.

625
00:52:36,386 --> 00:52:43,625
Allah is the Greatest!

626
00:52:49,346 --> 00:52:50,625
Commander Lucas.

627
00:52:55,346 --> 00:52:56,385
What is it, Hristo?

628
00:52:56,826 --> 00:52:59,865
The base near Akhisar castle was invaded.

629
00:53:00,826 --> 00:53:03,585
Who raided it?

630
00:53:03,626 --> 00:53:04,385
Osman.

631
00:53:04,826 --> 00:53:06,375
He attacked the Greek fire.

632
00:53:06,586 --> 00:53:08,105
The base fell.

633
00:53:08,346 --> 00:53:10,105
They invaded suddenly.
We couldn't see.

634
00:53:10,106 --> 00:53:12,105
They were too many Commander Lukas.

635
00:53:28,586 --> 00:53:30,865
You clumsy men!

636
00:53:33,066 --> 00:53:36,625
What did you do as Osman attacked?

637
00:53:36,626 --> 00:53:38,865
Did you run and hide?

638
00:53:41,826 --> 00:53:43,865
You're a shame to Byzantine!

639
00:53:43,866 --> 00:53:45,955
Why didn't you die?

640
00:53:46,586 --> 00:53:48,385
How dare you face me?

641
00:53:50,066 --> 00:53:52,385
The mine carriages full of iron...

642
00:53:52,826 --> 00:53:54,385
...they were fir...
-Shut up!

643
00:53:54,826 --> 00:53:57,385
No excuses!

644
00:54:00,586 --> 00:54:02,105
You said you didn't see?

645
00:54:02,106 --> 00:54:03,105
Yes.

646
00:54:05,066 --> 00:54:06,625
Take them.

647
00:54:07,066 --> 00:54:08,865
I'll punish them later.

648
00:54:10,826 --> 00:54:12,625
What is your order sir?

649
00:54:13,826 --> 00:54:16,385
Osman's avenging his spies.

650
00:54:16,386 --> 00:54:18,865
He wants Akhisar castle next.

651
00:54:18,866 --> 00:54:21,865
But he'll face us when he gets there.

652
00:54:22,066 --> 00:54:23,385
Give the order Hristo!

653
00:54:23,386 --> 00:54:24,385
Gather the army

654
00:54:24,386 --> 00:54:25,625
As you wish sir.

655
00:54:25,626 --> 00:54:26,865
And you...

656
00:54:29,826 --> 00:54:32,865
...will go to Osman as a messenger.

657
00:54:34,826 --> 00:54:36,105
You..

658
00:54:37,346 --> 00:54:41,105
will tell him not to enter a war he can't win.

659
00:54:45,826 --> 00:54:48,625
Come here Osman!

660
00:54:48,826 --> 00:54:54,385
Finally, it's the day
our swords will clash!

661
00:54:58,586 --> 00:54:59,865
Come here.

662
00:55:00,346 --> 00:55:03,105
Come here. Leave it here.

663
00:55:06,346 --> 00:55:07,625
It's lovely.

664
00:55:13,586 --> 00:55:16,105
Sort them by color.

665
00:55:16,346 --> 00:55:17,865
Okay Hatuns?

666
00:55:18,586 --> 00:55:22,105
Let's hurry a bit, we're
running out of time.

667
00:55:30,066 --> 00:55:31,865
Gonca.

668
00:55:41,346 --> 00:55:43,385
This is your doing.

669
00:55:44,826 --> 00:55:46,385
You made them hate me.

670
00:55:46,386 --> 00:55:48,385
Holofira, enough.

671
00:55:48,386 --> 00:55:50,625
I'm telling you, I didn't do anything.

672
00:55:50,626 --> 00:55:54,165
Besides, not everyone has to like you.

673
00:55:56,586 --> 00:55:59,385
It works in your favor right?

674
00:55:59,586 --> 00:56:01,625
Tell me.

675
00:56:01,826 --> 00:56:04,865
Who knows what you're thinking about.

676
00:56:06,346 --> 00:56:08,865
Besides, what will happen if they...

677
00:56:08,866 --> 00:56:11,385
...like you more Gonca?

678
00:56:11,586 --> 00:56:13,625
What are you trying to say?

679
00:56:13,626 --> 00:56:16,625
How would that help me Holofira?

680
00:56:17,346 --> 00:56:19,105
It's clear.

681
00:56:19,586 --> 00:56:23,105
You've memorized the
tricks of your mother very well.

682
00:56:31,826 --> 00:56:33,385
If you...

683
00:56:34,346 --> 00:56:38,865
...ever say anything about this.

684
00:56:39,066 --> 00:56:41,385
..I'll make you regret it.

685
00:57:00,346 --> 00:57:02,385
Bless your hands, sisters!

686
00:57:02,386 --> 00:57:04,865
Vegetables on this side.

687
00:57:07,586 --> 00:57:12,105
The carpets go there, we will
lay them down under the tables.

688
00:57:15,586 --> 00:57:17,385
Fatma Hatun.

689
00:57:17,826 --> 00:57:19,385
Do you need help?

690
00:57:19,386 --> 00:57:21,385
Thank you Saruca Bey.

691
00:57:21,386 --> 00:57:23,385
The alps and sisters can do it.

692
00:57:23,386 --> 00:57:24,865
Fatma Hatun.

693
00:57:24,866 --> 00:57:26,865
Congrats for your new duty.

694
00:57:26,866 --> 00:57:30,385
Then again we are used to
seeing you shooting arrows but...

695
00:57:30,386 --> 00:57:33,105
...this job suits you as well.

696
00:57:33,586 --> 00:57:38,565
When did you saw
me with a bow and an arrow?

697
00:57:38,565 --> 00:57:43,865
Oh, that time you couldn't
shoot the target!

698
00:57:45,346 --> 00:57:46,865
Of course.

699
00:57:46,866 --> 00:57:49,385
You must remember that time well.

700
00:57:49,386 --> 00:57:52,105
Turks are so generous.

701
00:57:52,106 --> 00:57:56,865
You can hardly see this
kind of preparation at bazaars.

702
00:57:56,866 --> 00:57:58,385
Thank you.

703
00:57:58,386 --> 00:58:01,865
Is this your first time
at a Turkish bazaar?

704
00:58:01,866 --> 00:58:03,865
We are always like this.

705
00:58:10,826 --> 00:58:13,625
Merchant Veronica.

706
00:58:14,586 --> 00:58:17,625
I see that you've met Fatma Hatun.

707
00:58:17,626 --> 00:58:19,105
Yes.

708
00:58:21,346 --> 00:58:25,105
She a very good archer.

709
00:58:27,826 --> 00:58:30,865
Praise be! Praise be! Praise be!

710
00:58:30,866 --> 00:58:34,385
May Allah protect her from the evil eye.

711
00:58:35,586 --> 00:58:39,105
Both her heart and her face are pretty.

712
00:58:41,346 --> 00:58:44,105
Just like Bala.

713
00:58:47,066 --> 00:58:50,385
I'm very pleased to meet you Fatma Hatun.

714
00:58:52,826 --> 00:58:55,105
Begum Hatun, excuse me.

715
00:58:55,106 --> 00:58:58,865
I still have a lot more
to see at the bazaar.

716
00:59:04,586 --> 00:59:07,625
Evil eyes... Go.

717
00:59:13,826 --> 00:59:15,865
Excuse me.

718
00:59:23,306 --> 00:59:24,855
Beys.

719
00:59:31,826 --> 00:59:35,105
The goods we will receive
tomorrow are very important.

720
00:59:35,106 --> 00:59:37,825
The women are trying
to prepare the stalls.

721
00:59:37,866 --> 00:59:39,625
Everything's with you right?

722
00:59:39,626 --> 00:59:41,385
Yes sister.

723
00:59:41,586 --> 00:59:43,105
Osman Bey.

724
00:59:44,346 --> 00:59:46,865
We've been ready ever
since he told us to be ready.

725
00:59:48,346 --> 00:59:50,865
But I don't know how things
are with Yusuf Bey, of course.

726
00:59:54,346 --> 00:59:55,625
Allah..

727
01:00:23,826 --> 01:00:27,625
-The horsemen will set out immediately.

728
01:00:27,826 --> 01:00:30,865
They'll support the defence of the castle.

729
01:00:32,586 --> 01:00:35,105
And the infantry...

730
01:00:35,826 --> 01:00:40,625
...will pass the the tunnel of Kuzgun...

731
01:00:41,586 --> 01:00:44,105
...and infiltrate into the castle.

732
01:00:45,346 --> 01:00:50,105
No one will hear anything.

733
01:00:50,106 --> 01:00:51,865
I want no mistake.

734
01:00:51,866 --> 01:00:54,625
As you command, Commander Lukas.

735
01:01:01,346 --> 01:01:03,105
Get out.

736
01:01:04,826 --> 01:01:08,625
You can't stop Osman alone, Lukas.

737
01:01:13,826 --> 01:01:17,385
You've increased the hatred of Osman.

738
01:01:18,066 --> 01:01:22,625
Now, you can't beat him alone.

739
01:01:22,826 --> 01:01:26,865
Then, I'll bury him with his own hatred!

740
01:01:27,066 --> 01:01:30,105
I'll stand before him even
if I know I'm going to die.

741
01:01:30,346 --> 01:01:32,625
Do it. Do it.

742
01:01:32,826 --> 01:01:34,625
Of course.

743
01:01:34,626 --> 01:01:37,625
But I will come with you.

744
01:01:37,826 --> 01:01:40,625
What are you talking about, Karasi Bey?

745
01:01:41,066 --> 01:01:42,385
Look.

746
01:01:43,066 --> 01:01:49,625
If Osman takes Aksihar Castle, he
will take the control of the trade road.

747
01:01:49,826 --> 01:01:54,105
My trade on the land will disappear.

748
01:01:54,346 --> 01:01:57,625
You think I'll risk this, Lukas?

749
01:01:57,826 --> 01:02:02,105
You always act for your own
benefit, Karasi Bey. Always!

750
01:02:05,346 --> 01:02:06,865
What do you propose

751
01:02:08,586 --> 01:02:12,105
We'll share everything in half.

752
01:02:12,346 --> 01:02:16,385
We will stop Osman together but...

753
01:02:16,386 --> 01:02:22,105
...you will give my share from
the trade on Aksihar Castle.

754
01:02:23,586 --> 01:02:25,865
How are you going to stop Osman?

755
01:02:26,066 --> 01:02:30,625
Tell me if you are up for the deal first.

756
01:02:31,906 --> 01:02:35,105
Okay. Let it be as you want.

757
01:02:35,586 --> 01:02:39,385
Let's stay as two armies
in one front, Karasi Bey.

758
01:02:40,346 --> 01:02:42,625
Good.

759
01:02:43,826 --> 01:02:46,105
Wait for news from me.

760
01:02:56,826 --> 01:03:00,625
I followed you once, Karasi.

761
01:03:00,626 --> 01:03:03,625
I won’t do the same
mistake for the second time.

762
01:03:03,626 --> 01:03:05,385
I'll be prepared.

763
01:03:17,066 --> 01:03:20,105
Stableman! Take care of this!

764
01:03:30,066 --> 01:03:31,625
This horse is new.

765
01:03:32,066 --> 01:03:32,865
Whose is it?

766
01:03:32,866 --> 01:03:35,379
Be sure it is well-fed.
This horse is a...

767
01:03:35,391 --> 01:03:38,105
...gift from Commander
Lukas to our new guest.

768
01:03:48,346 --> 01:03:52,385
Isn't this gifted horse for the
women, who killed Osman Bey's spy?

769
01:03:52,386 --> 01:03:55,439
Not one. I heard she
killed so many spies that

770
01:03:55,451 --> 01:03:58,385
she destroyed all the
intelligence Kayi had.

771
01:04:01,066 --> 01:04:03,544
What is the name of
this guest? If I know her name...

772
01:04:03,556 --> 01:04:06,105
...when I need
to prepare the horse...

773
01:04:06,106 --> 01:04:10,105
You will be commanded then.
Just do you job.

774
01:04:10,346 --> 01:04:12,105
Really, what is her name?

775
01:04:12,106 --> 01:04:15,865
I don’t know. I heard she
only speaks to Commander Lukas.

776
01:04:40,826 --> 01:04:43,385
Sancar...

777
01:04:44,066 --> 01:04:45,865
Karasi Bey...

778
01:04:47,826 --> 01:04:50,385
So, you are doing
something with Lukas again.

779
01:04:51,466 --> 01:04:54,625
NEAR AKSIHAR, KAYI HEADQUARTERS

780
01:05:29,586 --> 01:05:31,865
Peace be with you.

781
01:05:32,826 --> 01:05:34,105
Peace be upon you.

782
01:05:34,106 --> 01:05:36,385
Welcome Beys.

783
01:05:37,346 --> 01:05:41,385
Finally, your troops joined our army.

784
01:05:41,386 --> 01:05:42,625
Thank you.

785
01:05:42,626 --> 01:05:45,865
We are by your side with
all our forces, Osman Bey.

786
01:05:46,066 --> 01:05:50,105
Before the Kayi flag is
placed on the walls of Akhisar...

787
01:05:50,346 --> 01:05:53,865
...and the call of 
Mohammad echoes there...

788
01:05:53,866 --> 01:05:56,385
...we are not Beys, we are just
soldiers under your command my Bey.

789
01:05:57,066 --> 01:05:59,105
Thank you.

790
01:06:01,586 --> 01:06:04,105
The villages that send
rations to Akhisar...

791
01:06:04,586 --> 01:06:07,625
...and bases that send
weapons and ammunition there...

792
01:06:07,626 --> 01:06:11,105
...have been destroyed, with the
permission of Allah, Thank Allah.

793
01:06:11,106 --> 01:06:13,625
Thank Allah.

794
01:06:14,346 --> 01:06:17,865
The blood we spilled
in infidel villages today...

795
01:06:18,346 --> 01:06:22,385
...will be the assurance of what
we are going to do in those castles.

796
01:06:23,346 --> 01:06:26,625
My Bey, that dog Lucas
heard about our attack.

797
01:06:27,346 --> 01:06:30,385
He must have started gathering his army.

798
01:06:31,586 --> 01:06:34,625
Will Lucas enter the castle to defend it?

799
01:06:34,826 --> 01:06:39,385
Or is he going to try to
break our siege from butside?

800
01:06:42,826 --> 01:06:46,625
He can bring all his army in the castle.

801
01:06:46,826 --> 01:06:49,865
He can stand against
us with all his power.

802
01:06:50,346 --> 01:06:54,385
Lucas has nothing he can take...

803
01:06:54,586 --> 01:06:58,625
...other than surrendering,
defeat and death!

804
01:07:00,346 --> 01:07:02,865
Now, at dawn..

805
01:07:03,066 --> 01:07:05,105
...our army will go for Akhisar.

806
01:07:05,106 --> 01:07:08,385
And take position in
front of the castle for siege.

807
01:07:09,826 --> 01:07:11,865
To take Baysungur's revenge.

808
01:07:12,346 --> 01:07:14,385
To take our martyrs revenge.

809
01:07:14,386 --> 01:07:18,105
We will rain wrath down on them!

810
01:07:18,346 --> 01:07:23,865
With the help of Allah.

811
01:07:28,586 --> 01:07:32,625
Oghuz, isn't that Lucas' man?

812
01:07:32,826 --> 01:07:34,625
Yes.

813
01:07:44,066 --> 01:07:45,385
Make way.

814
01:07:47,346 --> 01:07:49,385
What are you doing here?

815
01:07:50,346 --> 01:07:53,865
You killed my brother Baysungur!

816
01:07:55,826 --> 01:07:58,625
How dare you come here?

817
01:07:58,626 --> 01:08:01,385
Brother, wait.

818
01:08:07,826 --> 01:08:10,105
I am here as Commander Lucas' messenger.

819
01:08:10,106 --> 01:08:12,105
I came to see Osman Bey.

820
01:08:12,346 --> 01:08:14,865
Alps, take his weapons.

821
01:08:36,826 --> 01:08:37,863
My Bey.

822
01:08:39,064 --> 01:08:42,385
Lucas' messenger has arrived.

823
01:08:42,586 --> 01:08:44,385
He wants to talk to you.

824
01:08:59,826 --> 01:09:01,385
Let him come.

825
01:09:03,586 --> 01:09:04,625
Orhan.

826
01:09:14,586 --> 01:09:15,863
Speak.

827
01:09:17,064 --> 01:09:19,385
What does the snake tongued Lucas want?

828
01:09:19,386 --> 01:09:22,385
If a war begins, it will be your end.

829
01:09:22,826 --> 01:09:25,385
Your army can never breach Akhisar walls.

830
01:09:25,826 --> 01:09:28,385
Byzantine soldiers will
not abstain from a war.

831
01:09:31,064 --> 01:09:33,625
Commander Lucas is
giving you a chance to live.

832
01:09:33,826 --> 01:09:36,863
Turn back and return to your tribes.

833
01:09:37,586 --> 01:09:40,863
Is that so?

834
01:09:48,826 --> 01:09:50,505
So be it.

835
01:10:08,826 --> 01:10:10,625
We drew our sword already.

836
01:10:11,066 --> 01:10:13,385
Before we avenge our martyrs...

837
01:10:14,346 --> 01:10:17,385
....and shed blood, we'll never back down.

838
01:10:19,586 --> 01:10:21,385
Go tell your master...

839
01:10:22,346 --> 01:10:24,625
...that the walls of the castle will fall.

840
01:10:25,346 --> 01:10:26,385
Akhisar...

841
01:10:27,066 --> 01:10:28,625
...will be Kayi's.

842
01:10:28,826 --> 01:10:31,385
Osman Bey, don't waste your Alps.

843
01:10:31,586 --> 01:10:33,865
Shut up! Take him!

844
01:10:36,586 --> 01:10:37,105
Come.

845
01:11:12,346 --> 01:11:13,105
Take him.

846
01:11:21,586 --> 01:11:23,385
If I were you...

847
01:11:24,346 --> 01:11:25,865
..I'd kill him.

848
01:11:26,586 --> 01:11:29,625
They shouldn't breathe.

849
01:11:32,586 --> 01:11:34,865
If they died, everyone would forget.

850
01:11:35,586 --> 01:11:37,105
They will live like this..

851
01:11:37,826 --> 01:11:40,385
...so that other soldiers will learn.

852
01:11:46,586 --> 01:11:47,865
Did you go to Sogut?

853
01:11:48,066 --> 01:11:49,385
I didn’t.

854
01:11:49,386 --> 01:11:52,625
I'm closer to them than ever.

855
01:11:53,586 --> 01:11:55,385
I have them in control.

856
01:11:55,826 --> 01:11:59,385
I can’t wait until tomorrow
Sofia. I'll leave soon.

857
01:12:00,066 --> 01:12:02,865
I can’t let these idiots protect Akhisar.

858
01:12:03,066 --> 01:12:04,105
You're right.

859
01:12:05,346 --> 01:12:07,105
But I don't think it's necessary.

860
01:12:08,586 --> 01:12:12,385
Osman will fall on his
knees and beg you...

861
01:12:13,066 --> 01:12:15,105
...for his daughter Fatma.

862
01:12:21,346 --> 01:12:23,385
You underestimate Osman.

863
01:12:24,346 --> 01:12:27,625
He always has a second plan.

864
01:12:27,826 --> 01:12:29,865
Don't overestimate him.

865
01:12:30,586 --> 01:12:31,865
That shepherd..

866
01:12:33,346 --> 01:12:36,385
...will beg us like a fool.

867
01:12:37,586 --> 01:12:41,625
Tomorrow we will be victorious Lukas.

868
01:12:42,586 --> 01:12:45,865
I'll bury them all in one grave.

869
01:12:55,066 --> 01:12:58,105
We'll bury them together Lukas.

870
01:13:11,346 --> 01:13:12,865
Who are you woman?

871
01:14:44,346 --> 01:14:47,385
Kayi Tribe

872
01:14:47,386 --> 01:14:48,625
So...

873
01:14:49,066 --> 01:14:51,385
..Gonca....Holofira.

874
01:14:51,826 --> 01:14:53,865
How was your day?

875
01:14:55,066 --> 01:14:57,625
Tell me about the market.

876
01:14:58,346 --> 01:15:01,385
It was good mother. My stall is ready.

877
01:15:01,826 --> 01:15:03,385
But...

878
01:15:08,826 --> 01:15:10,865
The Sisters gave Holofira a hard time.

879
01:15:13,826 --> 01:15:17,385
They’ll get used to it.
Don't worry Mother Bala.

880
01:15:17,386 --> 01:15:21,385
I'll do everything to earn their trust.

881
01:15:22,346 --> 01:15:25,105
Everything will be
ready until the morning.

882
01:15:25,106 --> 01:15:27,625
Praise be to my girl.

883
01:15:28,826 --> 01:15:30,625
You...

884
01:15:31,066 --> 01:15:33,865
..don't want war but...

885
01:15:34,826 --> 01:15:38,105
...Holofira Hatun has
already started that war.

886
01:15:44,066 --> 01:15:47,385
You can do anything, Holofira Hatun.

887
01:15:47,386 --> 01:15:51,105
The folk are like a fist, Holofira Hatun.

888
01:15:51,106 --> 01:15:54,625
They won't let anyone in easily.

889
01:15:55,826 --> 01:15:59,105
It's hard to earn their trust.

890
01:15:59,586 --> 01:16:01,105
Good.

891
01:16:02,066 --> 01:16:05,105
I like tough things, Begum,Hatun.

892
01:16:06,066 --> 01:16:08,105
That's it.

893
01:16:08,826 --> 01:16:12,865
You have to stand-up strong to
not allow people to trample you.

894
01:16:13,586 --> 01:16:16,625
They will respect you first...

895
01:16:17,346 --> 01:16:20,105
...and then like you.

896
01:16:25,346 --> 01:16:26,865
May I come in Bala Hatun?

897
01:16:26,866 --> 01:16:29,105
Come in Kismet.

898
01:16:30,066 --> 01:16:31,625
Bala Hatun.

899
01:16:31,626 --> 01:16:33,625
There is word from Osman Bey.

900
01:16:33,626 --> 01:16:36,105
Osman Bey has taken the
town and the headquarters.

901
01:16:36,106 --> 01:16:37,105
They are moving towards the Castle.

902
01:16:37,106 --> 01:16:39,865
Thank Allah.

903
01:16:39,866 --> 01:16:41,625
Praise be!

904
01:16:41,626 --> 01:16:45,385
Kismet, tell Ulgen to bring us sherbet.

905
01:16:46,346 --> 01:16:47,385
Praise be!

906
01:16:47,386 --> 01:16:49,385
Mother.

907
01:16:52,066 --> 01:16:54,385
I'm not complaining about my food duty.

908
01:16:54,386 --> 01:16:57,105
I really like working for the folk.

909
01:16:57,106 --> 01:17:00,105
But, when will I go to war?

910
01:17:00,106 --> 01:17:03,105
Will I always remain under your wings?

911
01:17:03,586 --> 01:17:06,105
Come here.

912
01:17:07,586 --> 01:17:10,105
What's wrong with our wings?

913
01:17:12,066 --> 01:17:14,105
Besides, don't you know it?

914
01:17:14,106 --> 01:17:17,105
Even if your nail gets broken..

915
01:17:17,106 --> 01:17:20,385
...both your father and I get so worried.

916
01:17:21,066 --> 01:17:22,865
Mother.

917
01:17:22,866 --> 01:17:25,385
I can protect myself.

918
01:17:25,386 --> 01:17:27,625
I train the the sisters!

919
01:17:27,626 --> 01:17:31,865
I even defeated Yusuf Bey
and Saruca Bey in archery.

920
01:17:38,346 --> 01:17:39,625
No.

921
01:17:40,066 --> 01:17:42,385
I can't stand that.

922
01:17:42,586 --> 01:17:45,625
If I go, then you can come with me.

923
01:17:45,626 --> 01:17:48,625
But I won't send you
off to the fight alone.

924
01:17:48,626 --> 01:17:52,105
Mother...

925
01:17:53,826 --> 01:17:56,625
You'll understand once
you're a mother too.

926
01:18:03,586 --> 01:18:06,625
Ever since Baysungur passed away...

927
01:18:06,626 --> 01:18:09,625
...there has been this
ache in my chest, brothers.

928
01:18:11,346 --> 01:18:13,625
My heart burns, Cerkutay.

929
01:18:16,586 --> 01:18:19,865
So does mine, brother.

930
01:18:20,586 --> 01:18:22,625
While...

931
01:18:23,826 --> 01:18:25,865
...he was going though...

932
01:18:25,866 --> 01:18:28,105
...all that torture for the nation...

933
01:18:28,346 --> 01:18:30,865
...we thought he fell as a martyr.

934
01:18:32,346 --> 01:18:34,865
Then we learned that...

935
01:18:34,866 --> 01:18:38,385
...he was alive and said thank Allah.

936
01:18:38,586 --> 01:18:41,105
He was with us.

937
01:18:42,066 --> 01:18:43,865
But just then..

938
01:18:44,586 --> 01:18:47,865
We buried him ourselves..

939
01:18:51,586 --> 01:18:55,865
I'll carry Baysungur's knife from now on.

940
01:18:57,586 --> 01:19:01,385
Even if I kill thousand infidels..

941
01:19:01,586 --> 01:19:03,865
..my pain won't die down.

942
01:19:06,346 --> 01:19:08,385
Our bey said revenge first...

943
01:19:08,826 --> 01:19:10,385
...and then mourning.

944
01:19:10,386 --> 01:19:13,865
But neither the things we did today...

945
01:19:14,066 --> 01:19:18,105
...nor the castle we will
get tomorrow helps my pain.

946
01:19:22,826 --> 01:19:24,385
Beys.

947
01:19:31,066 --> 01:19:33,865
Alps, what are you talking about?

948
01:19:36,586 --> 01:19:37,865
Aykurt.

949
01:19:37,866 --> 01:19:40,865
About our brother
Baysungur's passing, my bey.

950
01:19:40,866 --> 01:19:42,865
Our brother...

951
01:19:42,866 --> 01:19:47,105
We can’t stand that our martyr
passed away like that, my bey.

952
01:19:47,106 --> 01:19:50,625
Hold on.

953
01:19:54,346 --> 01:19:57,865
The wounds that were opened in Baysungur's
body in the most merciless way...

954
01:19:57,866 --> 01:20:01,385
Is this how you are
revenging those wounds?

955
01:20:04,066 --> 01:20:08,625
It's not the time to
take your heads down...

956
01:20:08,826 --> 01:20:13,105
...but it's time tear the enemy
into one-thousand pieces!

957
01:20:17,066 --> 01:20:19,105
Of course, our heart is on fire.

958
01:20:19,346 --> 01:20:21,625
Of course, we are in pain.

959
01:20:21,826 --> 01:20:27,385
But don't forget that we
will never fall into despair!

960
01:20:29,346 --> 01:20:32,371
Neither we will forged,
the martyrdom of Baysungur...

961
01:20:32,383 --> 01:20:35,865
...nor we will
let the enemy forget it!

962
01:20:41,066 --> 01:20:43,385
My Bey tells the truth, brothers!

963
01:20:43,386 --> 01:20:47,105
We won't fall into despair
so that the infidels...

964
01:20:47,346 --> 01:20:51,168
...will never think
that they could pay the

965
01:20:51,180 --> 01:20:55,625
martyrdom of Baysungur
and many more with a castle!

966
01:21:06,586 --> 01:21:11,105
And our love for
war haven't ran out...

967
01:21:12,066 --> 01:21:14,625
...and our motivation didn't die out!

968
01:21:19,066 --> 01:21:20,865
Brothers!

969
01:21:22,346 --> 01:21:24,625
Allah! Allah!

970
01:21:25,066 --> 01:21:27,385
Heads up!

971
01:21:27,826 --> 01:21:29,865
Resist!

972
01:21:33,586 --> 01:21:36,865
For the ones who fell
as martyrs for the state

973
01:21:36,866 --> 01:21:42,105
The days that we take our
revenge from all the infidels are near!

974
01:21:48,826 --> 01:21:50,385
Of course!

975
01:21:50,586 --> 01:21:55,865
We've never given up since the old times!

976
01:21:56,066 --> 01:21:59,105
We’ve always stood tall

977
01:22:00,066 --> 01:22:03,385
Even if one of us falls..

978
01:22:03,386 --> 01:22:07,865
...another of us will go to war
with the shouts of Allah! Allah!

979
01:22:08,066 --> 01:22:14,385
Allah is the greatest!

980
01:22:15,066 --> 01:22:19,105
For our ghazis who shout as Allah! Allah!

981
01:22:24,386 --> 01:22:28,105
For our martyrs whom we
wrapped with bloodied clothes!

982
01:22:32,826 --> 01:22:37,865
For our ancestors that
expect great victories from us!

983
01:22:37,866 --> 01:22:44,105
Allah is the greatest!

984
01:23:16,066 --> 01:23:19,865
Mother; Mother, save me! Mother!

985
01:23:21,346 --> 01:23:22,625
Fatma!

986
01:23:26,586 --> 01:23:29,385
Daughter! Fatma

987
01:23:29,386 --> 01:23:31,385
Where are you, daughter?

988
01:23:31,586 --> 01:23:34,385
I'm coming. Where are you?

989
01:23:34,386 --> 01:23:35,865
Fatma!

990
01:23:35,866 --> 01:23:37,385
Mother!

991
01:23:37,586 --> 01:23:38,625
Daughter.

992
01:23:39,586 --> 01:23:41,385
Mother, where are you? Mother!

993
01:23:41,386 --> 01:23:43,105
I'm coming, daughter.

994
01:23:43,106 --> 01:23:46,385
I'm coming. I'm coming.

995
01:23:53,826 --> 01:23:57,105
Fatma! Fatma!

996
01:23:57,586 --> 01:23:58,865
Where are you?

997
01:23:58,866 --> 01:24:00,385
Oh!

998
01:24:00,826 --> 01:24:01,865
Fatma!

999
01:24:01,866 --> 01:24:04,625
Mother, save me! Mother!

1000
01:24:04,626 --> 01:24:06,385
Fatma!

1001
01:24:09,066 --> 01:24:11,385
Where are you?

1002
01:24:13,346 --> 01:24:16,385
Where are you, daughter? My child

1003
01:24:17,586 --> 01:24:19,105
Mother!

1004
01:24:22,066 --> 01:24:24,865
Mother, where are you? Mother!

1005
01:24:27,066 --> 01:24:28,625
Mother!

1006
01:24:29,066 --> 01:24:30,865
Where are you?

1007
01:24:39,346 --> 01:24:41,105
Daughter

1008
01:24:44,066 --> 01:24:46,865
Don't do it! Stop

1009
01:24:47,826 --> 01:24:50,865
Mother, save me.

1010
01:24:50,866 --> 01:24:52,865
Don't do this!

1011
01:24:57,346 --> 01:25:02,865
No!

1012
01:25:14,066 --> 01:25:17,385
Fatma!

1013
01:25:23,586 --> 01:25:24,625
No!

1014
01:25:24,626 --> 01:25:26,385
No! Fatma!

1015
01:25:26,386 --> 01:25:29,105
No!

1016
01:25:29,106 --> 01:25:35,105
Fatma!

1017
01:25:43,826 --> 01:25:46,385
Oh Allah, don't let this dream come true.

1018
01:26:16,066 --> 01:26:18,625
Oh Allah, protect my children.

1019
01:26:25,066 --> 01:26:27,865
Near Osman Bey's Headquarters

1020
01:26:28,346 --> 01:26:29,385
My Beys.

1021
01:26:30,586 --> 01:26:31,625
My fellows.

1022
01:26:32,826 --> 01:26:35,625
Brave soldiers who love Allah!

1023
01:26:39,346 --> 01:26:42,865
I know all of you wait
to attack the enemy...

1024
01:26:42,866 --> 01:26:46,105
...like wild fire lit on an arrow.

1025
01:26:49,826 --> 01:26:50,625
It is time now.

1026
01:26:52,066 --> 01:26:53,105
In Allah's name..

1027
01:26:54,066 --> 01:26:56,625
...to build a world with
the Holy Laws of Allah...

1028
01:26:56,826 --> 01:26:58,385
..we'll be the executioners..

1029
01:26:59,346 --> 01:27:00,865
...of our enemies.

1030
01:27:01,066 --> 01:27:05,865
We'll be executioners!

1031
01:27:07,066 --> 01:27:07,865
Now it’s time.

1032
01:27:08,586 --> 01:27:09,625
For the state...

1033
01:27:10,586 --> 01:27:12,105
...for our traditions..

1034
01:27:12,106 --> 01:27:14,385
...and for our martyrs...

1035
01:27:14,826 --> 01:27:21,385
We'll walk to Shahada.

1036
01:27:22,346 --> 01:27:27,105
You're the brave men who reach
the target as soon as I show you it.

1037
01:27:27,826 --> 01:27:29,625
May Allah..

1038
01:27:31,586 --> 01:27:33,865
May Allah bless you all.

1039
01:27:33,866 --> 01:27:37,105
Ameen!

1040
01:27:39,346 --> 01:27:40,105
May your fists...

1041
01:27:41,066 --> 01:27:43,865
...be as strong as Allah's
lion, Hamza Hadrath...

1042
01:27:44,586 --> 01:27:47,865
...may your swords
be as sharp as Zulfiqar.

1043
01:27:48,066 --> 01:27:52,625
May your arrows find their targets
just like Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas.

1044
01:27:52,626 --> 01:27:56,385
Amen, amen, amen!

1045
01:27:58,066 --> 01:28:03,625
Against oppression and sin,
may we be victorious just...

1046
01:28:04,066 --> 01:28:05,865
..like our Prophet...

1047
01:28:05,866 --> 01:28:08,105
Peace Be Upon Him..

1048
01:28:09,346 --> 01:28:12,625
...and his army with Allah's permission.

1049
01:28:12,626 --> 01:28:17,105
Ameen.

1050
01:28:18,826 --> 01:28:20,385
May our war be blessed.

1051
01:28:20,386 --> 01:28:23,865
Ameen.

1052
01:28:40,346 --> 01:28:41,625
Tell me.

1053
01:28:41,626 --> 01:28:44,105
Food will be given out soon.

1054
01:28:50,346 --> 01:28:54,105
Only women work in there, no soldiers.

1055
01:28:54,586 --> 01:28:57,625
We're going to get Fatma from there.

1056
01:28:58,826 --> 01:29:01,105
At the right time...

1057
01:29:04,346 --> 01:29:06,105
Okay.

1058
01:29:06,106 --> 01:29:07,105
The cart?

1059
01:29:07,106 --> 01:29:09,105
It's ready, ma'am.

1060
01:29:09,106 --> 01:29:11,105
We hid it in the forest.

1061
01:29:36,066 --> 01:29:39,385
It seems Holofira got
the stalls ready on time.

1062
01:29:40,826 --> 01:29:42,625
She's an ambitious woman.

1063
01:29:47,586 --> 01:29:50,105
She thinks I'm the reason of Hatun's anger

1064
01:29:53,826 --> 01:29:56,385
She forgets what she caused...

1065
01:29:57,586 --> 01:29:59,625
and blames me.

1066
01:30:00,066 --> 01:30:02,385
She targets my most vulnerable point...

1067
01:30:04,586 --> 01:30:06,385
...which is my mother.

1068
01:30:06,386 --> 01:30:09,105
You are the Hatun of Shehzade.

1069
01:30:09,346 --> 01:30:11,625
Hide your wound, Gonca.

1070
01:30:11,826 --> 01:30:15,385
You have no friends
anymore. Don't forget this.

1071
01:30:19,826 --> 01:30:21,625
Especially, Holofira.

1072
01:30:21,826 --> 01:30:25,625
If she takes the support
of the family in the future...

1073
01:30:28,066 --> 01:30:30,385
Despite all the pain in my heart.

1074
01:30:31,586 --> 01:30:33,625
...I didn't attack her
where she is vulnerable.

1075
01:30:35,826 --> 01:30:37,105
Never.

1076
01:30:37,826 --> 01:30:41,105
Your mercy is making you make mistakes.

1077
01:30:44,066 --> 01:30:46,385
That war has begun.

1078
01:30:47,346 --> 01:30:49,625
If you say that you can't fight...

1079
01:30:50,066 --> 01:30:51,385
..not you..

1080
01:30:53,066 --> 01:30:55,385
...but shahzade Alaeddin will lose.

1081
01:30:55,586 --> 01:30:59,105
I would never let Alaeddin get harmed.

1082
01:31:02,826 --> 01:31:05,105
If she wants war...

1083
01:31:06,346 --> 01:31:07,625
then I will give it to her.

1084
01:31:14,586 --> 01:31:16,625
But Bala shouldn't realize it.

1085
01:31:23,586 --> 01:31:25,545
Thanks for your hard work, sisters.

1086
01:31:25,626 --> 01:31:27,385
It looks good.

1087
01:31:33,346 --> 01:31:36,865
Alps, take the goats to slaughterhouse.

1088
01:31:37,826 --> 01:31:41,385
Sisters, bring the cut meat.

1089
01:31:41,386 --> 01:31:42,625
Okay Fatma Hatun.

1090
01:31:46,066 --> 01:31:47,865
Come on.

1091
01:31:48,346 --> 01:31:50,625
People of Sogut are waiting for food!

1092
01:31:50,826 --> 01:31:53,385
Then they will have
to wait a little longer.

1093
01:32:04,066 --> 01:32:05,625
Who are you?

1094
01:32:06,346 --> 01:32:09,105
What are you doing
here? Leave immediately.

1095
01:32:09,586 --> 01:32:12,385
I am not going anywhere without you.

1096
01:32:12,826 --> 01:32:14,865
Osman’s daughter.

1097
01:32:16,346 --> 01:32:18,625
Are you out of your mind?

1098
01:32:18,626 --> 01:32:20,625
You are going to kidnap me from Sogut?

1099
01:32:20,626 --> 01:32:23,625
Don't worry about that.

1100
01:32:29,066 --> 01:32:30,865
Fatma Hatun.

1101
01:32:32,346 --> 01:32:33,865
Sisters!

1102
01:32:40,346 --> 01:32:41,385
You!

1103
01:32:42,586 --> 01:32:45,105
You will beg to live!

1104
01:32:45,346 --> 01:32:47,385
I will drown you
in your own blood!

1105
01:32:47,386 --> 01:32:50,385
Are you going to talk or fight?

1106
01:32:50,586 --> 01:32:54,105
You are a coward that
hides behind her mask!

1107
01:32:54,106 --> 01:32:56,385
And you will die as a coward!

1108
01:33:04,346 --> 01:33:06,865
Bala trained you well.

1109
01:33:07,586 --> 01:33:10,385
But fun is over.

1110
01:33:26,826 --> 01:33:28,385
Turks..

1111
01:33:31,066 --> 01:33:35,625
...think they can stand
against me. Pitiful.

1112
01:33:37,586 --> 01:33:39,625
Wrap this snake..

1113
01:33:41,346 --> 01:33:43,105
...in a carpet.

1114
01:34:07,066 --> 01:34:08,625
We are leaving.

1115
01:34:39,586 --> 01:34:41,865
Oh Allah, protect them.

1116
01:34:43,826 --> 01:34:44,625
Bala?

1117
01:34:47,586 --> 01:34:49,105
Thanks Ulgen.

1118
01:34:50,066 --> 01:34:51,865
In the name of Allah, the
merciful, the beneficent.

1119
01:35:00,826 --> 01:35:03,105
You've been acting weird since morning.

1120
01:35:04,586 --> 01:35:06,105
Are you okay?

1121
01:35:13,586 --> 01:35:15,625
I have an odd feeling.

1122
01:35:17,066 --> 01:35:19,105
I had a nightmare last night Ulgen.

1123
01:35:20,346 --> 01:35:21,865
What is it? Tell me.

1124
01:35:22,586 --> 01:35:23,865
I saw Fatma.

1125
01:35:28,066 --> 01:35:29,625
May Allah bless us.

1126
01:35:29,626 --> 01:35:30,385
Amen.

1127
01:35:30,386 --> 01:35:31,625
Let's think beautifully.

1128
01:35:32,066 --> 01:35:33,385
Yes, sure.

1129
01:35:34,346 --> 01:35:37,625
Did you send hatuns with her this morning?

1130
01:35:37,626 --> 01:35:39,385
I did of course.

1131
01:35:39,386 --> 01:35:41,625
She went there with Gonca and Holofira.

1132
01:35:43,346 --> 01:35:44,865
Good. Good.

1133
01:35:49,346 --> 01:35:50,865
Fatma's right.

1134
01:35:51,346 --> 01:35:53,385
You can't send her to battle.

1135
01:35:53,386 --> 01:35:54,385
I won’t.

1136
01:35:54,586 --> 01:35:56,625
She can only come if I go.

1137
01:35:56,626 --> 01:35:58,385
No other way

1138
01:35:58,386 --> 01:36:00,865
I'll watch over her.

1139
01:36:01,586 --> 01:36:02,515
Okay.

1140
01:36:04,346 --> 01:36:06,105
But, you know.

1141
01:36:06,826 --> 01:36:08,385
She'll get married.

1142
01:36:10,066 --> 01:36:11,105
One day...

1143
01:36:11,586 --> 01:36:13,105
She's old enough.

1144
01:36:13,826 --> 01:36:16,625
Men will want her as a wife.

1145
01:36:16,626 --> 01:36:17,385
So?

1146
01:36:18,346 --> 01:36:20,105
They might.

1147
01:36:20,586 --> 01:36:22,385
If we don't let her go...

1148
01:36:22,826 --> 01:36:24,625
...no one can take my girl, Ulgen.

1149
01:36:25,826 --> 01:36:29,625
So, you can control people's feelings?

1150
01:36:30,826 --> 01:36:31,865
Listen to me.

1151
01:36:34,066 --> 01:36:36,105
Is there something you won't tell me?

1152
01:36:36,826 --> 01:36:39,625
No. Why would I?

1153
01:36:39,626 --> 01:36:41,625
Is there?

1154
01:36:41,626 --> 01:36:42,625
No.

1155
01:36:44,346 --> 01:36:45,105
Okay.

1156
01:36:48,346 --> 01:36:50,865
Let's go then. I want to see my daughter.

1157
01:36:50,866 --> 01:36:53,105
-I need to relax.
-Let's go.

1158
01:37:01,066 --> 01:37:04,105
Akhisar Caste

1159
01:37:28,346 --> 01:37:29,865
Reinforce the gate!

1160
01:37:30,826 --> 01:37:33,625
Increase the units 4 times their size!

1161
01:37:33,826 --> 01:37:37,385
Today no one will enter this gate!

1162
01:37:37,826 --> 01:37:39,385
Archers!

1163
01:37:39,586 --> 01:37:43,105
You will even shoot the birds.

1164
01:37:43,826 --> 01:37:45,105
Osman!

1165
01:37:45,106 --> 01:37:49,105
You'll be crushed by an
army scarier than death.

1166
01:37:50,346 --> 01:37:51,865
Put it there! There!

1167
01:37:51,866 --> 01:37:53,385
Hurry! Now!

1168
01:37:57,066 --> 01:38:01,625
Here! Here! Put it there! There! Come on!

1169
01:38:07,826 --> 01:38:11,625
Fearless sons of the Holy Rome.

1170
01:38:12,586 --> 01:38:14,625
I have full faith in you.

1171
01:38:16,586 --> 01:38:17,625
Osman.

1172
01:38:19,826 --> 01:38:23,105
Osman thinks he's invincible.

1173
01:38:27,586 --> 01:38:31,385
Today we'll put him through hell!

1174
01:38:31,386 --> 01:38:39,105
Long Live Commander Lucas!

1175
01:38:45,066 --> 01:38:49,625
Come on Hatuns. Prepare
them all before Bala Hatun arrives.

1176
01:38:52,346 --> 01:38:56,105
She'll see how a real bazaar is set up.

1177
01:38:56,586 --> 01:38:57,865
She needs to learn.

1178
01:39:44,066 --> 01:39:45,625
Begum Hatun.

1179
01:39:48,346 --> 01:39:49,385
What is it?

1180
01:39:50,826 --> 01:39:52,865
You're leaving early. Where to?

1181
01:39:55,586 --> 01:39:59,385
Thanks to you we made good deals.

1182
01:40:18,066 --> 01:40:20,385
My work was done quickly today.

1183
01:40:20,386 --> 01:40:22,105
Good.

1184
01:40:22,826 --> 01:40:24,865
I'm happy to hear.

1185
01:40:27,826 --> 01:40:30,625
Did you meet Bala Hatun before?

1186
01:40:30,626 --> 01:40:32,385
No.

1187
01:40:32,386 --> 01:40:34,865
Not yet.

1188
01:40:40,346 --> 01:40:42,105
Now...

1189
01:40:42,346 --> 01:40:43,865
...if you excuse me...

1190
01:40:43,866 --> 01:40:45,865
If that's the case...

1191
01:40:46,066 --> 01:40:48,385
...then it's time that you meet her.

1192
01:40:48,386 --> 01:40:51,105
Bala Hatun is coming here.

1193
01:40:52,826 --> 01:40:55,385
I would've loved to but...

1194
01:40:56,826 --> 01:40:59,385
...I don't have time.

1195
01:40:59,386 --> 01:41:02,105
I made a promise to a merchant.

1196
01:41:02,106 --> 01:41:04,625
Next time.

1197
01:41:05,346 --> 01:41:07,625
It won't take long.

1198
01:41:08,066 --> 01:41:12,385
Come, drink some sherbet.
Bala Hatun will be here soon.

1199
01:41:12,386 --> 01:41:15,105
As I said I would've loved to but....

1200
01:41:15,106 --> 01:41:16,865
...I'm very busy today.

1201
01:41:16,866 --> 01:41:18,625
We'll talk tomorrow.

1202
01:41:18,626 --> 01:41:21,105
I'll meet Bala Hatun then too.

1203
01:41:21,586 --> 01:41:24,865
We'll trade a lot more, Begum Hatun

1204
01:41:24,866 --> 01:41:26,865
If that's the case...

1205
01:41:34,346 --> 01:41:36,105
Be quick.

1206
01:42:15,826 --> 01:42:19,105
There he is.

1207
01:42:24,346 --> 01:42:26,385
Karesi Bey.

1208
01:42:27,066 --> 01:42:29,385
We are going on a conquest.

1209
01:42:29,826 --> 01:42:34,625
I would say you're here to
support us, to work with us but...

1210
01:42:35,586 --> 01:42:39,625
...whenever we come across
you, you only make us turn back.

1211
01:42:39,826 --> 01:42:42,625
You're right Osman.

1212
01:42:44,346 --> 01:42:47,865
I'm here to make you turn back.

1213
01:42:47,866 --> 01:42:51,865
To tell you not to attack Akhisar.

1214
01:42:58,346 --> 01:43:00,385
Supporting us...

1215
01:43:00,386 --> 01:43:03,385
...working with us...
We can forget these.

1216
01:43:04,826 --> 01:43:08,385
And now you tell us not
to attack the infidels' land.

1217
01:43:12,346 --> 01:43:14,865
Is this how you act as a Turk?

1218
01:43:15,066 --> 01:43:16,865
Osman.

1219
01:43:17,066 --> 01:43:22,385
Is it your place to question
how much of a Turk I am?

1220
01:43:23,346 --> 01:43:25,385
Not for the infidels..

1221
01:43:25,386 --> 01:43:29,625
...I'm against you for
the future of my nation.

1222
01:43:31,826 --> 01:43:33,865
Sancar.

1223
01:43:52,066 --> 01:43:53,385
You see it.

1224
01:43:53,386 --> 01:43:56,385
Lucas and I have an agreement.

1225
01:44:00,586 --> 01:44:05,105
From now on my caravans
will travel to Bitinya...

1226
01:44:05,106 --> 01:44:07,625
...across Akhisar.

1227
01:44:07,626 --> 01:44:09,865
What I'm saying is...

1228
01:44:09,866 --> 01:44:13,625
...that Akhisar is a
point in my trade route.

1229
01:44:13,826 --> 01:44:17,865
I'll consider the attack you lash out...

1230
01:44:18,066 --> 01:44:20,865
...out on me, on my nation.

1231
01:44:22,066 --> 01:44:24,865
If you attack Akhisar...

1232
01:44:33,066 --> 01:44:34,865
What will you do?

1233
01:44:35,826 --> 01:44:38,385
Look, I won't care that you're Turkish...

1234
01:44:38,386 --> 01:44:41,625
...and we share the same lineage.

1235
01:44:42,066 --> 01:44:45,385
I'll attack you on every front.

1236
01:44:46,346 --> 01:44:48,625
Here is the battlefield.

1237
01:44:49,066 --> 01:44:50,865
Here is your opponent.

1238
01:44:51,066 --> 01:44:52,865
Come on Karesi Bey.

1239
01:44:54,346 --> 01:44:56,385
Come on, face me.

1240
01:44:56,826 --> 01:44:58,385
Osman.

1241
01:44:59,066 --> 01:45:04,385
Know that disrespect against
me never be left unpunished.

1242
01:45:05,346 --> 01:45:08,105
I'll finish the ones
you worked with first.

1243
01:45:09,066 --> 01:45:10,385
Then..

1244
01:45:11,066 --> 01:45:13,385
Then your time will come, too.

1245
01:45:13,826 --> 01:45:16,385
Whatever you say, Osman.

1246
01:45:16,826 --> 01:45:19,385
Let it be as you said.

1247
01:45:19,386 --> 01:45:25,105
When I destroy your world, 
I'll make you remember your words..

1248
01:45:33,346 --> 01:45:36,865
Who sunk the ship? Could you find him?

1249
01:45:36,866 --> 01:45:40,385
Who put the stones on the chests?

1250
01:45:41,066 --> 01:45:42,865
Huh, Karasi Bey?

1251
01:45:48,346 --> 01:45:50,105
Osman.

1252
01:45:50,826 --> 01:45:52,625
Osman, of course.

1253
01:46:09,586 --> 01:46:10,865
I'll check the cart.

1254
01:46:10,866 --> 01:46:12,625
I'll take care of it, Yusuf.

1255
01:46:12,826 --> 01:46:15,385
I know what goes out
and in the bazaar well.

1256
01:46:16,826 --> 01:46:19,385
Don't kill these ones.

1257
01:46:19,386 --> 01:46:22,865
Both of them the sons of
the Beys. They will be useful.

1258
01:46:32,066 --> 01:46:34,105
Pull over there.

1259
01:46:37,826 --> 01:46:39,385
Trader.

1260
01:46:42,066 --> 01:46:43,865
What are you doing here?

1261
01:46:44,066 --> 01:46:45,865
We are returning from the bazaar.

1262
01:46:45,866 --> 01:46:47,625
Where are you going?

1263
01:46:47,826 --> 01:46:50,625
We’ll check the cart. It’s the rules.

1264
01:46:50,626 --> 01:46:54,385
-We need to check what you are carrying. 
-Of course, please.

1265
01:46:56,066 --> 01:46:58,385
What do you have in the chests? Open them.

1266
01:46:59,826 --> 01:47:02,865
Come on.

1267
01:47:04,346 --> 01:47:06,385
Come on, come on.

1268
01:47:06,586 --> 01:47:08,105
Open them open.

1269
01:47:09,066 --> 01:47:10,625
Come on.

1270
01:47:14,346 --> 01:47:16,865
Come on, come on, quickly. Come on.

1271
01:47:41,586 --> 01:47:42,605
Ambush!

1272
01:47:45,586 --> 01:47:47,625
Who the hell are you?

1273
01:47:50,066 --> 01:47:53,105
Do you know on whom
you set ambush, dastards?

1274
01:47:53,106 --> 01:47:56,385
Don't let them talk. Finish this now!

1275
01:48:12,826 --> 01:48:15,105
Bring the caged cart! Come on!

1276
01:48:15,106 --> 01:48:18,385
Leave me! Leave me! Dastards! Leave me!

1277
01:48:18,826 --> 01:48:21,385
Leave me! Yusuf!

1278
01:48:21,586 --> 01:48:25,385
-Hold on, Yusuf!
-You think you can get away with this, huh?

1279
01:48:25,386 --> 01:48:27,865
Leave me!
Come on!

1280
01:48:33,586 --> 01:48:34,865
Come!

1281
01:48:41,066 --> 01:48:43,385
Throw them inside!

1282
01:48:43,826 --> 01:48:46,385
You think you can get away with this, huh?

1283
01:48:52,346 --> 01:48:55,625
Leave me!

1284
01:49:01,346 --> 01:49:02,625
Trader!

1285
01:49:02,826 --> 01:49:05,865
You won't be able to
get away with this, trader!

1286
01:49:05,866 --> 01:49:07,625
Unroll it!

1287
01:49:08,826 --> 01:49:11,625
You will pay for all this!

1288
01:49:15,626 --> 01:49:17,105
Fatma!

1289
01:49:17,346 --> 01:49:19,625
Fatma Hatun!

1290
01:49:24,066 --> 01:49:25,625
Osman.

1291
01:49:26,586 --> 01:49:29,865
Your heart is in my hands, Osman.

1292
01:49:33,586 --> 01:49:36,105
Veronica!

1293
01:49:36,346 --> 01:49:38,865
You won't be able to get away with this!

1294
01:49:39,586 --> 01:49:40,865
Take her.

1295
01:49:42,466 --> 01:49:44,625
Fatma Hatun!

1296
01:49:48,066 --> 01:49:49,865
Throw her inside!

1297
01:49:50,826 --> 01:49:52,625
Get ready!

1298
01:49:53,346 --> 01:49:56,385
We are going to Akhisar!

1299
01:49:57,826 --> 01:49:59,865
I have a gift for them

1300
01:50:01,826 --> 01:50:06,105
Fatma Hatun.

1301
01:50:09,586 --> 01:50:11,385
Fatma Hatun, wake up!

1302
01:50:19,066 --> 01:50:19,865
Fatma Hatun.

1303
01:50:20,346 --> 01:50:21,865
Wake up!

1304
01:50:26,346 --> 01:50:28,625
Merchant!

1305
01:50:28,626 --> 01:50:31,105
This will be your end!

1306
01:50:31,346 --> 01:50:32,105
Merchant!

1307
01:50:32,106 --> 01:50:33,865
You will pay for this!

1308
01:50:33,866 --> 01:50:36,625
I swear you will pay for this!

1309
01:51:29,066 --> 01:51:32,625
Like we spoke, when the siege starts...

1310
01:51:33,346 --> 01:51:37,385
...Bayhan and Gencer Beys
will protect the army’s flanks.

1311
01:51:37,386 --> 01:51:40,385
As you command my Bey!

1312
01:51:45,586 --> 01:51:47,105
Osman Bey.

1313
01:51:47,346 --> 01:51:49,385
Ilbay, did you find any trace?

1314
01:51:49,386 --> 01:51:51,385
I did, my Bey.

1315
01:51:53,786 --> 01:51:57,455
The one that martyred
Baysungur and our spies...

1316
01:51:57,826 --> 01:52:00,865
...is a guest of Commander Lucas.

1317
01:52:01,826 --> 01:52:03,385
I don’t know her name.

1318
01:52:03,826 --> 01:52:07,385
No one knows her name in the
castle. All I know that it's a woman.

1319
01:52:16,066 --> 01:52:18,385
A woman with Lucas.

1320
01:52:18,386 --> 01:52:20,625
A hatun with devil eyes.

1321
01:52:21,066 --> 01:52:24,105
She is working together
with Lucas and Karesi Bey.

1322
01:52:27,826 --> 01:52:30,105
I know Karesi. Tell me about the others.

1323
01:52:30,346 --> 01:52:31,105
My Bey.

1324
01:52:31,586 --> 01:52:34,625
Lucas is waiting for you
at Akhisar with his armies.

1325
01:52:34,626 --> 01:52:36,105
That's all I know.

1326
01:52:36,106 --> 01:52:37,625
I couldn't learn anything else.

1327
01:52:37,826 --> 01:52:39,865
But you could expect
anything from that woman.

1328
01:52:42,346 --> 01:52:44,105
Okay.

1329
01:52:44,106 --> 01:52:45,865
You can go back.

1330
01:52:57,066 --> 01:52:59,385
They are planning something in Akhisar?

1331
01:53:04,066 --> 01:53:07,625
Beys, alps. The preparations are complete.

1332
01:53:09,346 --> 01:53:11,385
We will ruin their plans.

1333
01:53:13,346 --> 01:53:15,625
Akhisar will become Turks' land today.

1334
01:53:16,346 --> 01:53:18,625
God willing, my Bey.

1335
01:53:24,066 --> 01:53:26,385
But that demon woman.

1336
01:53:27,346 --> 01:53:29,625
We have a score to settle.

1337
01:53:30,066 --> 01:53:32,105
And I will take her life.

1338
01:53:34,066 --> 01:53:34,865
Come on.

1339
01:53:43,586 --> 01:53:46,105
We were attacked, Bala Hatun!

1340
01:53:46,346 --> 01:53:47,625
We were attacked!

1341
01:53:47,626 --> 01:53:49,385
Yusuf's alp!

1342
01:53:53,066 --> 01:53:55,865
Hold him!

1343
01:53:56,066 --> 01:53:57,385
What happened?

1344
01:53:58,826 --> 01:54:01,385
Tell me what happened.

1345
01:54:01,386 --> 01:54:03,865
They kidnapped Fatma Hatun.

1346
01:54:14,586 --> 01:54:15,625
Fatma?

1347
01:54:15,626 --> 01:54:17,385
What was Fatma doing there?

1348
01:54:18,066 --> 01:54:21,625
We were attacked on the road.

1349
01:54:24,586 --> 01:54:25,625
What about Yusuf?

1350
01:54:26,066 --> 01:54:27,385
Saruca?

1351
01:54:27,386 --> 01:54:30,105
They were taken prisoner.

1352
01:54:30,346 --> 01:54:33,105
Oh Allah! Saruca!

1353
01:54:33,106 --> 01:54:37,385
Oh Allah, take my life instead!

1354
01:54:37,386 --> 01:54:40,865
Allah!

1355
01:54:41,066 --> 01:54:42,865
Bring the horses

1356
01:54:42,866 --> 01:54:46,385
Take him to the healing tent!

1357
01:54:50,066 --> 01:54:51,865
What are we going to do?

1358
01:54:52,066 --> 01:54:55,385
Oh Allah, protect my child.

1359
01:54:56,066 --> 01:54:58,385
Bring my horse!

1360
01:54:59,346 --> 01:55:01,865
Come on!

1361
01:55:20,066 --> 01:55:23,865
I told you I’d cut out
your lifeline Osman.

1362
01:55:29,346 --> 01:55:30,865
Fatma Hatun.

1363
01:55:31,066 --> 01:55:32,865
Are you okay Fatma Hatun?

1364
01:55:32,866 --> 01:55:34,625
Saruca Bey?

1365
01:55:34,626 --> 01:55:36,625
Yusuf Bey? You..

1366
01:55:36,826 --> 01:55:38,385
Why are you here?

1367
01:55:44,346 --> 01:55:46,865
You...You..

1368
01:55:47,346 --> 01:55:48,865
Merchant Veronika!

1369
01:55:48,866 --> 01:55:50,865
You...You snake!

1370
01:55:51,066 --> 01:55:53,105
I'm not Veronika.

1371
01:55:54,346 --> 01:55:58,105
I am your father's and
the Turk's biggest enemy.

1372
01:56:00,346 --> 01:56:02,865
What do you want to do?

1373
01:56:02,866 --> 01:56:04,865
Tell me where we're going!

1374
01:56:06,346 --> 01:56:11,105
If you're brave release these
chains and face me! Come on!

1375
01:56:11,586 --> 01:56:13,105
Bravery?

1376
01:56:13,826 --> 01:56:15,865
I am the apocalypse.

1377
01:56:19,346 --> 01:56:22,385
I'll end Osman and Bala..

1378
01:56:24,066 --> 01:56:25,385
But first...

1379
01:56:25,826 --> 01:56:29,105
...I'll give them pain before they die.

1380
01:56:30,346 --> 01:56:32,105
I'm not afraid of you

1381
01:56:32,106 --> 01:56:34,625
You'll never get away with this!

1382
01:56:34,626 --> 01:56:36,625
Never!

1383
01:56:37,346 --> 01:56:39,385
Don't you ever think of consequences?

1384
01:56:39,826 --> 01:56:42,105
You'll pay for this merchant.

1385
01:56:42,106 --> 01:56:44,105
You'll pay greatly.

1386
01:56:44,106 --> 01:56:45,625
Shut up!

1387
01:56:46,066 --> 01:56:48,105
You're my slaves from now on.

1388
01:56:50,346 --> 01:56:52,105
I'm not afraid of you!

1389
01:56:52,106 --> 01:56:53,865
I'm not afraid of you! I'll never be!

1390
01:56:53,866 --> 01:56:55,865
Let us go! Let us go!

1391
01:56:56,066 --> 01:57:00,385
What you're doing won't
go unpunished! Never!

1392
01:57:03,586 --> 01:57:04,865
Of course.

1393
01:57:05,066 --> 01:57:07,385
Of course Fatma Hatun. Don't be afraid.

1394
01:57:07,586 --> 01:57:08,625
Fatma Hatun

1395
01:57:09,346 --> 01:57:11,625
These dastards can’t hurt you.

1396
01:57:11,626 --> 01:57:12,865
I'll protect you.

1397
01:57:15,346 --> 01:57:18,625
I'll protect you with
my own life if I have to.

1398
01:57:18,626 --> 01:57:20,625
I'll get you to your tribe safely.

1399
01:57:22,586 --> 01:57:24,865
Me too Fatma Hatun. Me too.

1400
01:57:25,346 --> 01:57:26,385
I'll die..

1401
01:57:26,826 --> 01:57:29,625
...before I let them take you.

1402
01:57:33,346 --> 01:57:36,385
If you want to die so much..

1403
01:57:36,826 --> 01:57:38,385
...just wait.

1404
01:57:38,586 --> 01:57:40,865
I'll take you to the grave.

1405
01:57:43,066 --> 01:57:44,105
Gladly.

1406
01:58:03,346 --> 01:58:04,385
Fatma!

1407
01:58:06,826 --> 01:58:09,385
Mother. Where’s Fatma?

1408
01:58:23,826 --> 01:58:25,625
What did they do to you?

1409
01:58:27,066 --> 01:58:29,625
They kidnapped Fatma Hatun.

1410
01:58:29,626 --> 01:58:30,865
We couldn't stop them.

1411
01:58:30,866 --> 01:58:32,105
Who did it?

1412
01:58:32,106 --> 01:58:34,105
We don't know Bala Hatun.

1413
01:58:37,346 --> 01:58:40,625
They took Saruca Bey and Yusuf Bey too.

1414
01:58:43,586 --> 01:58:44,865
Yusuf?

1415
01:58:45,586 --> 01:58:46,625
Brother?

1416
01:58:53,346 --> 01:58:56,865
Indeed, we belong to Allah,
and indeed, to Him we return.

1417
01:58:59,586 --> 01:59:01,385
What did they do to our children?

1418
01:59:03,586 --> 01:59:05,625
Is he alive Gonca Hatun?

1419
01:59:05,626 --> 01:59:07,385
He is. But he fainted.

1420
01:59:14,066 --> 01:59:15,625
Saruca.

1421
01:59:18,066 --> 01:59:19,625
This is Saruca's.

1422
01:59:21,066 --> 01:59:23,105
Saruca.

1423
01:59:24,066 --> 01:59:25,385
My son.

1424
01:59:25,586 --> 01:59:27,385
Dastards!

1425
01:59:27,826 --> 01:59:29,865
What did you do to our children?

1426
01:59:31,826 --> 01:59:34,385
My son!

1427
01:59:35,066 --> 01:59:36,625
Dastards!

1428
01:59:37,586 --> 01:59:38,865
Alps!

1429
01:59:39,066 --> 01:59:42,385
Send word to Alps and watchers!

1430
01:59:42,386 --> 01:59:44,385
Search everywhere.

1431
01:59:44,826 --> 01:59:46,385
The castles nearby...

1432
01:59:47,066 --> 01:59:48,625
...and the tribes.

1433
01:59:49,346 --> 01:59:50,385
Don't wait here.

1434
01:59:51,346 --> 01:59:51,865
Mother.

1435
01:59:52,346 --> 01:59:55,385
Who took Fatma?
Where are they going?

1436
01:59:55,826 --> 01:59:59,385
We'll find all 3 of them Gonca!
We will.

1437
02:00:02,826 --> 02:00:04,865
They went that way.

1438
02:00:04,866 --> 02:00:07,865
You stay here and tend to the wounded.

1439
02:00:07,866 --> 02:00:09,625
I'll go after them.

1440
02:00:09,626 --> 02:00:11,385
Okay mother.

1441
02:00:11,586 --> 02:00:13,105
Come on

1442
02:00:13,106 --> 02:00:14,625
Bala Hatun.

1443
02:00:14,626 --> 02:00:16,625
I'll come with you.

1444
02:00:18,346 --> 02:00:19,865
Come on.

1445
02:00:21,066 --> 02:00:22,625
How could they do this?

1446
02:00:26,346 --> 02:00:27,105
Come on.

1447
02:00:28,066 --> 02:00:29,625
How could you?

1448
02:00:29,626 --> 02:00:32,105
Come on sisters.

1449
02:00:41,066 --> 02:00:42,865
Commander Lucas.

1450
02:00:43,066 --> 02:00:46,105
Osman Bey is coming up
to the walls with his army.

1451
02:00:46,346 --> 02:00:48,385
Osman.

1452
02:00:49,066 --> 02:00:52,385
I'm glad Karesi Bey couldn't stop you.

1453
02:00:52,386 --> 02:00:55,105
Since Sofia didn't send word..

1454
02:00:55,106 --> 02:00:58,385
...it's my pleasure to kill you.

1455
02:00:58,386 --> 02:01:00,385
Come on Hristo.

1456
02:01:00,386 --> 02:01:02,385
Let's welcome Osman.

1457
02:01:18,586 --> 02:01:20,865
You devil..

1458
02:01:25,066 --> 02:01:26,625
Let's see...

1459
02:01:26,826 --> 02:01:29,625
...if you're as brave as you say you are.

1460
02:01:31,346 --> 02:01:33,385
Osman Bey.

1461
02:01:34,586 --> 02:01:36,385
Welcome.

1462
02:01:37,066 --> 02:01:40,625
But you'll wish you never came here today.

1463
02:01:41,586 --> 02:01:44,865
If there is someone who is
going to wish for something...

1464
02:01:45,346 --> 02:01:47,865
...then it will be you Lucas.

1465
02:01:48,066 --> 02:01:51,105
When my sword is up on your neck...

1466
02:01:51,106 --> 02:01:53,625
...you'll be wishing for my mercy.

1467
02:01:55,586 --> 02:01:57,105
Now.

1468
02:01:58,346 --> 02:02:00,865
Either you give the castle to me...

1469
02:02:00,866 --> 02:02:01,625
Or?

1470
02:02:01,626 --> 02:02:05,865
Or you'll die with all those infidels.

1471
02:02:07,826 --> 02:02:11,385
Won't you see the
waIls I'm standing on?

1472
02:02:11,386 --> 02:02:13,385
Besides..

1473
02:02:13,386 --> 02:02:15,385
I have more men in this castle...

1474
02:02:15,386 --> 02:02:18,105
...than your army.

1475
02:02:18,106 --> 02:02:21,385
We climbed so many walls like these.

1476
02:02:21,386 --> 02:02:25,625
Karadin is the biggest proof of that.

1477
02:02:26,066 --> 02:02:29,865
But if you're talking about
the amount of men we have...

1478
02:02:29,866 --> 02:02:32,385
...you’re wrong once again, Lucas.

1479
02:02:32,386 --> 02:02:36,385
One of my men is
worth five of your knights.

1480
02:02:37,826 --> 02:02:42,625
But if you say don't let my
knights die, let's not battle...

1481
02:02:42,626 --> 02:02:45,105
...then come face me.

1482
02:02:46,066 --> 02:02:49,385
Here is the battlefield, here you are...

1483
02:02:50,586 --> 02:02:52,385
..and here I stand.

1484
02:02:54,066 --> 02:02:56,625
Come let us fight.

1485
02:02:58,586 --> 02:03:00,385
Fight...

1486
02:03:01,066 --> 02:03:04,385
You're asking me to duel you, is that it?

1487
02:03:04,386 --> 02:03:05,865
Let's see...

1488
02:03:05,866 --> 02:03:11,625
...if you have the bravery
and strength to face me.

1489
02:03:12,346 --> 02:03:15,525
You did a good thing for
your army, commander.

1490
02:03:15,626 --> 02:03:18,865
But I can't say
the same for you.

1491
02:03:42,826 --> 02:03:45,105
Get them out.

1492
02:03:46,066 --> 02:03:48,665
Bring them to me.

1493
02:03:49,346 --> 02:03:51,865
Stay close to me.

1494
02:04:18,826 --> 02:04:20,385
Break them.

1495
02:04:44,826 --> 02:04:46,865
Damn you.

1496
02:04:46,866 --> 02:04:49,385
Run away and save yourself.

1497
02:04:49,386 --> 02:04:51,865
She wants you, not us.

1498
02:04:51,866 --> 02:04:53,385
Yusuf is right.

1499
02:04:53,386 --> 02:04:54,385
Go now.

1500
02:04:54,386 --> 02:04:58,385
No, we're going to
leave together. Come on!

1501
02:05:01,586 --> 02:05:03,865
Idiots!

1502
02:05:04,066 --> 02:05:06,625
Where are you running?

1503
02:05:08,346 --> 02:05:10,865
This is my world.

1504
02:05:10,866 --> 02:05:14,385
You can't get out of here without dying!

1505
02:05:15,826 --> 02:05:20,105
We are never afraid of death, dastard!

1506
02:05:20,106 --> 02:05:22,385
-Come on!
-This way! Come on!

1507
02:05:41,346 --> 02:05:42,865
My soldiers.

1508
02:05:43,346 --> 02:05:47,105
Both will die with a single mistake.

1509
02:05:50,586 --> 02:05:52,105
Fatma

1510
02:06:01,586 --> 02:06:04,385
If you don’t behave..

1511
02:06:05,346 --> 02:06:07,385
I'll take your life.

1512
02:06:07,386 --> 02:06:13,105
You will pay for this, you ignoble!

1513
02:06:13,106 --> 02:06:15,865
-You think so?
-I do.

1514
02:06:19,346 --> 02:06:23,105
-No! No!
-Tie their hands!

1515
02:06:25,346 --> 02:06:27,385
-Brother!
-Take them!

1516
02:06:43,826 --> 02:06:46,625
Why did you accept this duel, Osman Bey?

1517
02:06:46,626 --> 02:06:50,625
We've surrounded the castle!
We could capture it, for sure!

1518
02:06:50,626 --> 02:06:53,625
If he hadn’t accepted my offer...

1519
02:06:53,826 --> 02:06:56,625
...then, we would have
washed these walls with blood.

1520
02:06:56,626 --> 02:07:00,114
Thank Allah, we have
the opportunity to take...

1521
02:07:00,126 --> 02:07:03,625
...this castle without
giving one single martyr.

1522
02:07:07,826 --> 02:07:09,105
Orhan.

1523
02:07:09,346 --> 02:07:10,385
My Bey.

1524
02:07:11,586 --> 02:07:14,385
If I fall as a martyr here...

1525
02:07:17,826 --> 02:07:20,865
...you will return with the army.

1526
02:07:21,066 --> 02:07:23,105
As you Command, my Bey.

1527
02:07:34,586 --> 02:07:38,385
Osman is a cunning warrior,
Commander. Be careful.

1528
02:07:38,586 --> 02:07:41,105
He's not cunning as much as I am.

1529
02:07:43,066 --> 02:07:44,625
Orhan.

1530
02:07:55,826 --> 02:07:57,625
Come here.

1531
02:07:59,586 --> 02:08:03,385
In the name of Allah, the
merciful, the beneficent.

1532
02:08:08,586 --> 02:08:13,385
Since you've come to these
lands, the devil is everywhere.

1533
02:08:13,586 --> 02:08:17,625
It's enough. It's time
for you to pay the price.

1534
02:08:18,066 --> 02:08:21,105
You will pay the price with your life.

1535
02:08:21,346 --> 02:08:23,385
Let's see then.

1536
02:08:39,586 --> 02:08:41,625
Come on, my Bey.

1537
02:09:12,066 --> 02:09:14,625
Ignoble! He's cheating.

1538
02:09:14,626 --> 02:09:17,625
Stop there, Alaaddin

1539
02:09:24,826 --> 02:09:30,385
You don't care to cheat even before
the warriors in the battleground, huh?

1540
02:09:57,066 --> 02:09:58,105
Why did we stop?

1541
02:09:58,826 --> 02:10:00,625
Trails end here.

1542
02:10:01,066 --> 02:10:05,385
But there's only Akhisar
castle on this side of the forest.

1543
02:10:06,826 --> 02:10:09,105
Come. on. To Akhisar castle.

1544
02:10:09,346 --> 02:10:10,385
Come on.

1545
02:10:15,826 --> 02:10:18,865
Let me go. Let go!

1546
02:10:21,346 --> 02:10:25,105
Akhisar will be the end of
you and your father Fatma.

1547
02:10:25,826 --> 02:10:27,625
My father will save us.

1548
02:10:27,626 --> 02:10:30,625
He won’t let us stay in
the nest of devils! Let go!

1549
02:10:33,826 --> 02:10:34,625
Walk!

1550
02:10:58,826 --> 02:11:03,625
Akhisar, Karadin or the other
lands you took from Byzantine...

1551
02:11:03,626 --> 02:11:06,865
None of them will be
yours Osman. None of them.

1552
02:11:06,866 --> 02:11:10,385
All of the people that you share blood
with who faced me ended up in hell.

1553
02:11:10,386 --> 02:11:12,625
You will share the same end.

1554
02:11:21,066 --> 02:11:23,105
Praise be!

1555
02:11:38,586 --> 02:11:41,625
Lucas huh? Lucas..

1556
02:11:45,826 --> 02:11:48,625
No Osman, no.

1557
02:11:48,626 --> 02:11:49,865
I won’t die today.

1558
02:11:49,866 --> 02:11:52,865
I won't by your hands.

1559
02:11:54,346 --> 02:11:56,385
-No!
-You say so?

1560
02:11:56,586 --> 02:11:58,105
My Bey!

1561
02:12:07,066 --> 02:12:09,385
Osman Bey!

1562
02:12:12,346 --> 02:12:14,865
Osman! Fatma!

1563
02:12:15,066 --> 02:12:16,625
What happened to Fatma?

1564
02:12:16,826 --> 02:12:18,385
Osman!

1565
02:12:20,066 --> 02:12:23,105
Your daughter, Fatma, is here.

1566
02:12:23,106 --> 02:12:24,865
Fatma!

1567
02:12:26,066 --> 02:12:27,345
Sister!

1568
02:12:27,386 --> 02:12:28,585
Fatma!

1569
02:12:28,626 --> 02:12:30,625
My Fatma

1570
02:12:42,066 --> 02:12:44,865
You ignoble dogs!

1571
02:12:53,066 --> 02:12:57,385
You faceless dog! You, dastard!

1572
02:12:57,386 --> 02:13:01,385
If you touch my
daughter, if your hurt her...

1573
02:13:01,386 --> 02:13:05,105
...you'll find yourself in the grave.

1574
02:13:07,826 --> 02:13:10,265
You, too, Lukas! You, too!

1575
02:13:12,346 --> 02:13:15,385
I'll erase both of you from this world!